(2000757, 276279, 43434, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the title ... is it meant to be "double latte"?  The concept is ood, and I must wonder how long you stood waiting for the right shot.  The movement you have captured added life to the picture.  The man does seem slightly distorted if you look at this papers.</td>', 'I don''t get the title ... is it meant to be "double latte"?  The concept is ood, and I must wonder how long you stood waiting for the right shot.  The movement you have captured added life to the picture.  The man does seem slightly distorted if you look at this papers.', '2006-01-04 00:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
