(2000832, 274756, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. I like the lights atop the lightposts. Very nicely done for a night shot.</td>', 'Very pretty. I like the lights atop the lightposts. Very nicely done for a night shot.', '2006-01-04 00:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2000835, 274980, 49337, '<td valign="top">ok how do you do that. it is a great picture.</td>', 'ok how do you do that. it is a great picture.', '2006-01-04 00:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2000846, 276479, 49007, '<td valign="top">Relevant to the Challenge? Mixed feelings. One could argue that citylife should actually show LIFE/LIVING/LIVELINESS.<br/>Is subject unique? Yes<br/> <br/>Compostion: Good or Bad? How can it be fixed? The focus should be the mountains and the city. The tree and lit road draw the eye away from the city and mountain. Is there anything else that should be removed? I''m not fond of the intersection and traffic light, personal preference. <br/>Good use of Depth of Field? Yes<br/> <br/>Good use of light? Yes and no. I like the natural light on the mountains. Good Exposure time, but the overblown headlight trail detracts from the image.<br/> <br/>What is my reaction or feelings? The mountains are very majestic, but the city seems to be an afterthought. The bottom 1/4 make the image average.<br/></td>', 'Relevant to the Challenge? Mixed feelings. One could argue that citylife should actually show LIFE/LIVING/LIVELINESS.Is subject unique? Yes Compostion: Good or Bad? How can it be fixed? The focus should be the mountains and the city. The tree and lit road draw the eye away from the city and mountain. Is there anything else that should be removed? I''m not fond of the intersection and traffic light, personal preference. Good use of Depth of Field? Yes Good use of light? Yes and no. I like the natural light on the mountains. Good Exposure time, but the overblown headlight trail detracts from the image. What is my reaction or feelings? The mountains are very majestic, but the city seems to be an afterthought. The bottom 1/4 make the image average.', '2006-01-04 00:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2000860, 274474, 43434, '<td valign="top">Three modes one picture.  Good capture.  I like how the light is playing on the road making it look quite wavy (or is that my eyesight) 7.</td>', 'Three modes one picture.  Good capture.  I like how the light is playing on the road making it look quite wavy (or is that my eyesight) 7.', '2006-01-04 00:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
