(2000920, 275638, 5885, '<td valign="top">love the color and framing... it doesn''t say Big City to me... which a lot of shots are going for... but I''m not going to DNMC ya on this ... good work.</td>', 'love the color and framing... it doesn''t say Big City to me... which a lot of shots are going for... but I''m not going to DNMC ya on this ... good work.', '2006-01-04 01:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
