(2000952, 275063, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love this.  The vivid contrast of the colors - the movement of the people and cars.  Great symmetrical capture.</td>', 'Love this.  The vivid contrast of the colors - the movement of the people and cars.  Great symmetrical capture.', '2006-01-04 01:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2000953, 275073, 41521, '<td valign="top">LOL - i love this picture.  I''ve seen dogs dressed in every way imaginable, but never a cat in a coat, and on a leash to boot.  You must be in a large city :)</td>', 'LOL - i love this picture.  I''ve seen dogs dressed in every way imaginable, but never a cat in a coat, and on a leash to boot.  You must be in a large city :)', '2006-01-04 01:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2000956, 275242, 15711, '<td valign="top">Is that Alfred Hitchcock over to the right?????</td>', 'Is that Alfred Hitchcock over to the right?????', '2006-01-04 01:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2000959, 276157, 5885, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, I think it''d done well in the Patterns challenge also.</td>', 'Nice photo, I think it''d done well in the Patterns challenge also.', '2006-01-04 01:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2000960, 275286, 49007, '<td valign="top">Relevant to the Challenge? Yes<br/>Is subject unique (vs. unoriginal or rehashed)? Yes<br/> <br/>Compostion, Good or Bad? Good, however, I would crop a bit off the right side so the the tower was less dominant and the bottom to remove some of he indistinguishable bits. I do have a question about what you mean to have as the focus of the image -- the people, the taxis, or the market. Good Depth of Field.<br/> <br/>Good use of light? Mostly. The one sign in the upper right is over-exposed due to the reflected sun, but the shadows are good. Nothing is blocked-up.<br/> <br/>What is my reaction or feelings? I want to go to this market and wander about. This image draws me in.</td>', 'Relevant to the Challenge? YesIs subject unique (vs. unoriginal or rehashed)? Yes Compostion, Good or Bad? Good, however, I would crop a bit off the right side so the the tower was less dominant and the bottom to remove some of he indistinguishable bits. I do have a question about what you mean to have as the focus of the image -- the people, the taxis, or the market. Good Depth of Field. Good use of light? Mostly. The one sign in the upper right is over-exposed due to the reflected sun, but the shadows are good. Nothing is blocked-up. What is my reaction or feelings? I want to go to this market and wander about. This image draws me in.', '2006-01-04 01:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2000962, 275356, 13688, '<td valign="top">very interesting shot.  i don''t know why it took me a few seconds to recognize the other girl''s face...it just raised my impression of the shot to facinating ;)  I''m going to wonder for a moment what this shot might look like if the flash wasn''t so harsh...i''ll let that go now.</td>', 'very interesting shot.  i don''t know why it took me a few seconds to recognize the other girl''s face...it just raised my impression of the shot to facinating ;)  I''m going to wonder for a moment what this shot might look like if the flash wasn''t so harsh...i''ll let that go now.', '2006-01-04 01:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2000963, 274649, 43434, '<td valign="top">This is a good concept.  It is a pity that the clouds are making the talking tree hard to see.</td>', 'This is a good concept.  It is a pity that the clouds are making the talking tree hard to see.', '2006-01-04 01:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
