(2001501, 274613, 46097, '<td valign="top">This is amazing. I was about to submit my photo, of the same place, for this challenge too. If you took this on Monday the 2nd, at Southbank around lunchtime, then I was there too, shooting away. In the end, I didnt submit my photo, but yours is a great shot of city life.</td>', 'This is amazing. I was about to submit my photo, of the same place, for this challenge too. If you took this on Monday the 2nd, at Southbank around lunchtime, then I was there too, shooting away. In the end, I didnt submit my photo, but yours is a great shot of city life.', '2006-01-04 02:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001512, 274344, 49007, '<td valign="top">Where''s the city?</td>', 'Where''s the city?', '2006-01-04 02:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001514, 274658, 49007, '<td valign="top">Where''s the life?</td>', 'Where''s the life?', '2006-01-04 02:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001519, 274393, 37252, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning!</td>', 'Absolutely stunning!', '2006-01-04 02:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001562, 273816, 5728, '<td valign="top">Well I didn''t know who Jane Creba was but I just had a look on the net and read the story. So sad, really sad!</td>', 'Well I didn''t know who Jane Creba was but I just had a look on the net and read the story. So sad, really sad!', '2006-01-04 02:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001570, 276107, 16241, '<td valign="top">adorable!</td>', 'adorable!', '2006-01-04 02:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001576, 276105, 30861, '<td valign="top">Horton Plaza in San Diego? We shot this for the architects when it was first built, in the 70''s :-) A nice shot.</td>', 'Horton Plaza in San Diego? We shot this for the architects when it was first built, in the 70''s :-) A nice shot.', '2006-01-04 02:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001579, 276479, 30861, '<td valign="top">That the headlights are coming at you is very unfortunate. How much nicer without them... The BG part is lovely.</td>', 'That the headlights are coming at you is very unfortunate. How much nicer without them... The BG part is lovely.', '2006-01-04 02:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001584, 275950, 30861, '<td valign="top">What on earth happened here? This is a horribly pixelated image. It''s potentially a very nice picture too. If you don''t understand how to resize images for challenges, feel free to contact me, even during the voting period if you wish.</td>', 'What on earth happened here? This is a horribly pixelated image. It''s potentially a very nice picture too. If you don''t understand how to resize images for challenges, feel free to contact me, even during the voting period if you wish.', '2006-01-04 02:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001648, 273892, 1647, '<td valign="top">I like the moody colours - suits the gang theme.  The un-level horizon is more distracting rather than adding to the mood though and there is no real focus point.</td>', 'I like the moody colours - suits the gang theme.  The un-level horizon is more distracting rather than adding to the mood though and there is no real focus point.', '2006-01-04 03:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001652, 276348, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great concept.  Are they really cycling into the traffic, or stationary beside parked cars?  Composition is good.  The colours are quite flat (ie: lacking in contrast) but it kind of adds to the shot - kind of says "NYC isn''t that nice/happy/exciting right now for me".  Great work.</td>', 'Great concept.  Are they really cycling into the traffic, or stationary beside parked cars?  Composition is good.  The colours are quite flat (ie: lacking in contrast) but it kind of adds to the shot - kind of says "NYC isn''t that nice/happy/exciting right now for me".  Great work.', '2006-01-04 03:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001654, 275895, 1647, '<td valign="top">Hmm - Myers Christmas windows in Melbourne.  I like the composition, and the inclusion of a person (covers the "Life" criteria in my opinion) and the colours make the shot interesting.  Good work.</td>', 'Hmm - Myers Christmas windows in Melbourne.  I like the composition, and the inclusion of a person (covers the "Life" criteria in my opinion) and the colours make the shot interesting.  Good work.', '2006-01-04 03:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001655, 276065, 1647, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming the title is sarcasm?  Because the image doesn''t portray "Joy" to me.  I love the black and white effect, I love the composition (the person really makes the shot and covers the "Life" component of the challenge) and I like the high-contrast chosen.  Best photo I''ve seen so far.  Worthy of printing.</td>', 'I''m assuming the title is sarcasm?  Because the image doesn''t portray "Joy" to me.  I love the black and white effect, I love the composition (the person really makes the shot and covers the "Life" component of the challenge) and I like the high-contrast chosen.  Best photo I''ve seen so far.  Worthy of printing.', '2006-01-04 03:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001657, 274081, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice work capturing night lights without over-exposing.  Unfortunately the bright lights near the bottom draw my attention away from the buildings without adding much to the shot.  Perhaps a title like "Cities don''t sleep" might have portrayed the "Life" component of the challenge more.</td>', 'Nice work capturing night lights without over-exposing.  Unfortunately the bright lights near the bottom draw my attention away from the buildings without adding much to the shot.  Perhaps a title like "Cities don''t sleep" might have portrayed the "Life" component of the challenge more.', '2006-01-04 03:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001661, 276067, 1647, '<td valign="top">There''s plenty of "Life" in this shot!  I like the composition very much.  The sepia is a nice touch and the simple black border really works.  It almost looks a touch over-sharpened but it''s difficult working with such small image sizes.  Great title too - good work.</td>', 'There''s plenty of "Life" in this shot!  I like the composition very much.  The sepia is a nice touch and the simple black border really works.  It almost looks a touch over-sharpened but it''s difficult working with such small image sizes.  Great title too - good work.', '2006-01-04 03:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001667, 274492, 1647, '<td valign="top">Lovely moody dramatic shot.  Could be at one of the bush-fires here in Australia.  I love the composition and colour, sharpness is wonderful.  It perhaps doesn''t convey "City" very much, but other than that it''s perfect.  Definitely at the top-end of the results in my opinion.</td>', 'Lovely moody dramatic shot.  Could be at one of the bush-fires here in Australia.  I love the composition and colour, sharpness is wonderful.  It perhaps doesn''t convey "City" very much, but other than that it''s perfect.  Definitely at the top-end of the results in my opinion.', '2006-01-04 03:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001670, 275950, 1647, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately you will suffer for the pixellation of this shot.  I like the concept though.</td>', 'Unfortunately you will suffer for the pixellation of this shot.  I like the concept though.', '2006-01-04 03:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001691, 274553, 31443, '<td valign="top">Don''t see where this fits into the challenge, only city folks laugh out loud? Funny expression though..</td>', 'Don''t see where this fits into the challenge, only city folks laugh out loud? Funny expression though..', '2006-01-04 04:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001725, 275336, 48560, '<td valign="top">A very strong potrayal of city life. Good use of grain too.</td>', 'A very strong potrayal of city life. Good use of grain too.', '2006-01-04 04:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001727, 276105, 48560, '<td valign="top">I yearn to see what is down below. Might have been better for me if you would show more of the things below, from a top-looking-down sort of view.</td>', 'I yearn to see what is down below. Might have been better for me if you would show more of the things below, from a top-looking-down sort of view.', '2006-01-04 04:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001763, 276418, 47730, '<td valign="top">clever pic...</td>', 'clever pic...', '2006-01-04 05:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001767, 274553, 47730, '<td valign="top">good photo but i''m not sure how it fits into "City Life"...</td>', 'good photo but i''m not sure how it fits into "City Life"...', '2006-01-04 05:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001770, 276290, 50199, '<td valign="top">so.. how exactly do you get these little star lights? Is this some photoshop thing, a special filter, or what? I''ve seen a lot of these lately... Nice shot, btw, I''m just curious.</td>', 'so.. how exactly do you get these little star lights? Is this some photoshop thing, a special filter, or what? I''ve seen a lot of these lately... Nice shot, btw, I''m just curious.', '2006-01-04 05:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001772, 275940, 47730, '<td valign="top">photo is too small...probably everyone has made that comment.  I submitted my photo this size for the last challenge I entered and had 40 comments all saying "too small!!"  :)</td>', 'photo is too small...probably everyone has made that comment.  I submitted my photo this size for the last challenge I entered and had 40 comments all saying "too small!!"  :)', '2006-01-04 05:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001774, 275102, 47730, '<td valign="top">photo looks a bit dull.  i think it would have looked better in another light or at night with all the city lights maybe?</td>', 'photo looks a bit dull.  i think it would have looked better in another light or at night with all the city lights maybe?', '2006-01-04 05:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001778, 275328, 47730, '<td valign="top">i like the colours of this photo..</td>', 'i like the colours of this photo..', '2006-01-04 05:16:50.000000', NULL, 1);
