(2001914, 275286, 5728, '<td valign="top">I remember tuks tuks very well. Hectic city scene!</td>', 'I remember tuks tuks very well. Hectic city scene!', '2006-01-04 07:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001918, 276472, 35357, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the time exposure, I love night shots.  Unfortunately, your image is pretty small.  You should try to make it as big as possible for these challenges, as people prefer that.  640 pixels is allowed.  I suggest you take a peek at the "Learn" section of this website, there you''ll find a tutorial called "A Quick Visual Guide to Resampling".  It''ll give you a better idea of what I''m talking about.  Keep it up.  Cheers.</td>', 'Nice job on the time exposure, I love night shots.  Unfortunately, your image is pretty small.  You should try to make it as big as possible for these challenges, as people prefer that.  640 pixels is allowed.  I suggest you take a peek at the "Learn" section of this website, there you''ll find a tutorial called "A Quick Visual Guide to Resampling".  It''ll give you a better idea of what I''m talking about.  Keep it up.  Cheers.', '2006-01-04 07:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001924, 273622, 35357, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, this is about as un-city as you can get.</td>', 'In my opinion, this is about as un-city as you can get.', '2006-01-04 07:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001928, 276316, 5728, '<td valign="top">He looks like he has a lot of stories to tell, but look at his tobacco stained fingers, eeek!</td>', 'He looks like he has a lot of stories to tell, but look at his tobacco stained fingers, eeek!', '2006-01-04 07:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001934, 276120, 35357, '<td valign="top">I like the motion/action you caught as the firemen walk &amp; especially the one getting his arm into his sleeve.  I would have panned/cropped a bit to the left.  I like how the photo is filled/crowded with cars &amp; buildings.  Good job, IMO, on catching a city feel.</td>', 'I like the motion/action you caught as the firemen walk & especially the one getting his arm into his sleeve.  I would have panned/cropped a bit to the left.  I like how the photo is filled/crowded with cars & buildings.  Good job, IMO, on catching a city feel.', '2006-01-04 07:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2001941, 276298, 35357, '<td valign="top">I often jump over people in order to survive in the city, so I know where you''re coming from.  Your subject is clear, but the focus is a bit off.</td>', 'I often jump over people in order to survive in the city, so I know where you''re coming from.  Your subject is clear, but the focus is a bit off.', '2006-01-04 07:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
