(2002742, 274055, 19035, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo! I like the cropping and the use of color, I find myself converting too many of these type of photos to Black and White.  I have taken a lot of shots similar to this and this one I like, he looks so tired or stoned, not sure which.  8  .</td>', 'Excellent photo! I like the cropping and the use of color, I find myself converting too many of these type of photos to Black and White.  I have taken a lot of shots similar to this and this one I like, he looks so tired or stoned, not sure which.  8  .', '2006-01-04 12:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2002786, 276362, 21617, '<td valign="top">Looks more like city death  : )</td>', 'Looks more like city death  : )', '2006-01-04 12:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2002805, 276418, 48529, '<td valign="top">Without the title this would have been pretty much impossible to understand. Cute and all, but othewise didn''t do much for me...</td>', 'Without the title this would have been pretty much impossible to understand. Cute and all, but othewise didn''t do much for me...', '2006-01-04 12:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2002812, 275395, 48529, '<td valign="top">This is by MSG, yeah? I was just there for a Rangers game last week. I''m also in NYC, and took probably a dozen pics like this - until I realized that this was the stereotypical ''city shot''. <br/> <br/>My eye keeps getting drawn to the back of the taxi cab right in front - which isn''t that interesting. Maybe this would have been more interesting if our perspective was from higher up?</td>', 'This is by MSG, yeah? I was just there for a Rangers game last week. I''m also in NYC, and took probably a dozen pics like this - until I realized that this was the stereotypical ''city shot''.  My eye keeps getting drawn to the back of the taxi cab right in front - which isn''t that interesting. Maybe this would have been more interesting if our perspective was from higher up?', '2006-01-04 12:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2002814, 275036, 48529, '<td valign="top">Black &amp; White = correct choice for this subject. Maybe showing _more_ of the police car would have made it even better?</td>', 'Black & White = correct choice for this subject. Maybe showing _more_ of the police car would have made it even better?', '2006-01-04 12:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2002818, 275328, 48529, '<td valign="top">This seems out of focus to me? I personally would have liked it better if you had waited a few seconds for the guy in the dark coat in front to move out of the frame.</td>', 'This seems out of focus to me? I personally would have liked it better if you had waited a few seconds for the guy in the dark coat in front to move out of the frame.', '2006-01-04 12:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2002827, 276120, 48529, '<td valign="top">This would have been even better if you had moved in close on the fireman in front, with the firetruck lights in back slightly blurred.</td>', 'This would have been even better if you had moved in close on the fireman in front, with the firetruck lights in back slightly blurred.', '2006-01-04 12:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2002832, 275073, 6519, '<td valign="top">So often, cute cat photos are shoe-horned into challenges. This one, however, has a reason to be here. It makes sense.<br/>What a clever way to show the difference of "city life"!!!!<br/>On top of all that, it''s a lovely photo, too. Well done! 9</td>', 'So often, cute cat photos are shoe-horned into challenges. This one, however, has a reason to be here. It makes sense.What a clever way to show the difference of "city life"!!!!On top of all that, it''s a lovely photo, too. Well done! 9', '2006-01-04 12:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
