(2004009, 275215, 1647, '<td valign="top">I love the colours against the gloomy background.  This shot really has a lot of atmosphere about it.  I might have preferred it without the fish-eye effect, but its difficult to say without seeing it - I think a bunch of the silohuetted lamp-poles towering up would have looked great with it.  Good work.</td>', 'I love the colours against the gloomy background.  This shot really has a lot of atmosphere about it.  I might have preferred it without the fish-eye effect, but its difficult to say without seeing it - I think a bunch of the silohuetted lamp-poles towering up would have looked great with it.  Good work.', '2006-01-04 17:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004012, 275950, 18080, '<td valign="top">WOW - was this taken on a mobile phone camera. The grain and pixel size is just too much.<br/>Good luck though</td>', 'WOW - was this taken on a mobile phone camera. The grain and pixel size is just too much.Good luck though', '2006-01-04 17:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004016, 275420, 1647, '<td valign="top">I love the concept, and the title works really well.  I would have liked a slightly wider shot if possible, and some more detail visible in the brickwork, but I do like the colours and warmth of the lit window.  Good work.</td>', 'I love the concept, and the title works really well.  I would have liked a slightly wider shot if possible, and some more detail visible in the brickwork, but I do like the colours and warmth of the lit window.  Good work.', '2006-01-04 17:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004020, 275356, 1647, '<td valign="top">Cool shot - nice colours and great effect.  I also like the sharpness of this shot - lots of detail visible.  She really paints the eye-shadow on eh?</td>', 'Cool shot - nice colours and great effect.  I also like the sharpness of this shot - lots of detail visible.  She really paints the eye-shadow on eh?', '2006-01-04 17:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004027, 275742, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - yet another black+white photo (so many in this challenge).  I like the concept (similar to my original plan).  My only suggestion would be to try a different composition.  The pole and light coloured walkway/roadway draw attention away from the person.  Perhaps a more aggressive crop of the person, or a different background would have been more effective.</td>', 'Nice shot - yet another black+white photo (so many in this challenge).  I like the concept (similar to my original plan).  My only suggestion would be to try a different composition.  The pole and light coloured walkway/roadway draw attention away from the person.  Perhaps a more aggressive crop of the person, or a different background would have been more effective.', '2006-01-04 17:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004029, 274788, 9002, '<td valign="top">burn out is too much for me sorry</td>', 'burn out is too much for me sorry', '2006-01-04 17:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
