(2004160, 274649, 47020, '<td valign="top">Hmm, with the contrast and color and such, this has definite potential...  I''m afraid I''m not much of a fan of the overall composition, though.  Perhaps the cell tower could have been made to be further to the left in the frame?  Even making a square crop of this otherwise-as-is might work, though that does get rid of the sun...  Not sure what''s best, just some thoughts.  Somewhere in the 6 to 7 range for me.</td>', 'Hmm, with the contrast and color and such, this has definite potential...  I''m afraid I''m not much of a fan of the overall composition, though.  Perhaps the cell tower could have been made to be further to the left in the frame?  Even making a square crop of this otherwise-as-is might work, though that does get rid of the sun...  Not sure what''s best, just some thoughts.  Somewhere in the 6 to 7 range for me.', '2006-01-04 18:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004165, 273622, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot but I don''t really see how it depicts city life.</td>', 'This is a nice shot but I don''t really see how it depicts city life.', '2006-01-04 18:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004168, 276472, 7322, '<td valign="top">Egads this is too small. It''s too bad because it looks like it might be a fun blur of traffic lights. Please take advantage of the 640 pixel max next time. <br/>It is too hard to evaluate such a small shot.</td>', 'Egads this is too small. It''s too bad because it looks like it might be a fun blur of traffic lights. Please take advantage of the 640 pixel max next time. It is too hard to evaluate such a small shot.', '2006-01-04 18:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004172, 275846, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very nice! I like the concept of viewing the city from the outskirts. I like the way the curvy lines of shrubbery lead the viewer into the skyline. Great effort!</td>', 'Very nice! I like the concept of viewing the city from the outskirts. I like the way the curvy lines of shrubbery lead the viewer into the skyline. Great effort!', '2006-01-04 18:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004176, 275286, 7322, '<td valign="top">This looks very bustling. It might be a bit too cluttered to really appreciate. I think more of the problem for me is the somewhat faded looking color. I''d really love to see the color of that green building in the distance popping, for example. Also the yellow of those cabs (?) could be much more saturated.</td>', 'This looks very bustling. It might be a bit too cluttered to really appreciate. I think more of the problem for me is the somewhat faded looking color. I''d really love to see the color of that green building in the distance popping, for example. Also the yellow of those cabs (?) could be much more saturated.', '2006-01-04 18:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004178, 276290, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice. Not super original but it took some effort to achieve, I''m guessing.</td>', 'Nice. Not super original but it took some effort to achieve, I''m guessing.', '2006-01-04 18:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004182, 274083, 47020, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  I would like it if there was just a _tad_ more space to the right of that side-view mirror... otherwise great.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  I would like it if there was just a _tad_ more space to the right of that side-view mirror... otherwise great.', '2006-01-04 18:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004183, 274817, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the naturalistic humor aspect of this shot. i wish it wasn''t quite so faded and overexposed looking. It doesn''t quite gel for me in the end.</td>', 'I like the naturalistic humor aspect of this shot. i wish it wasn''t quite so faded and overexposed looking. It doesn''t quite gel for me in the end.', '2006-01-04 18:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
