(2004192, 276105, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a nice crisp exposure. It is kind of a ho-hum view for me, although it does look like a beautiful place. Perhaps a slightly different angle or shallow er depth of field. It just looks a bit flat to me. I''m not quite sure exactly why (although I''m really leaning toward a different angle of view).</td>', 'This is a nice crisp exposure. It is kind of a ho-hum view for me, although it does look like a beautiful place. Perhaps a slightly different angle or shallow er depth of field. It just looks a bit flat to me. I''m not quite sure exactly why (although I''m really leaning toward a different angle of view).', '2006-01-04 18:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004196, 276457, 7322, '<td valign="top">This kind of looks like my neck of the woods (Providence, RI ) but I''m pretty sure it''s not. This does depict city life. It doesn''t quite grab me though.I think the lighting could be a bit more dramatic perhaps. The highlight areas (her face and the surface she is leaning on) are very flat looking.</td>', 'This kind of looks like my neck of the woods (Providence, RI ) but I''m pretty sure it''s not. This does depict city life. It doesn''t quite grab me though.I think the lighting could be a bit more dramatic perhaps. The highlight areas (her face and the surface she is leaning on) are very flat looking.', '2006-01-04 18:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004198, 275939, 7322, '<td valign="top">Ooohhh! Very nice. I like the super crips exposure of the lights and the mostly blurred skaters. this is very magical looking. I really like it.</td>', 'Ooohhh! Very nice. I like the super crips exposure of the lights and the mostly blurred skaters. this is very magical looking. I really like it.', '2006-01-04 18:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004201, 274201, 7322, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Ultimately, not highly original or particularlly engaging. There is too much view of the dashboard which isn''t really very interesting.</td>', 'Interesting. Ultimately, not highly original or particularlly engaging. There is too much view of the dashboard which isn''t really very interesting.', '2006-01-04 18:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004203, 274788, 7322, '<td valign="top">Kennedy Plaza!! I like the blurred pedestrians. I''d like the lighting to be a bit more dramatic. It is quite overexposed in the area of the square. Extra point because this is my home turf!</td>', 'Kennedy Plaza!! I like the blurred pedestrians. I''d like the lighting to be a bit more dramatic. It is quite overexposed in the area of the square. Extra point because this is my home turf!', '2006-01-04 18:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004206, 275745, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the exaggerated angle and the spontanaity of this shot. I would like it to be a bit sharper in focus and less drab appearing. The yellow of the hot dog sign could be much more vibrant and the boy''s skin tone less ashy appearing.</td>', 'I like the exaggerated angle and the spontanaity of this shot. I would like it to be a bit sharper in focus and less drab appearing. The yellow of the hot dog sign could be much more vibrant and the boy''s skin tone less ashy appearing.', '2006-01-04 18:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004207, 274114, 7322, '<td valign="top">Way too small. I''m sure I''m not the first to mention it. Looks like it could be interesting but too hard to evaluate at this size.</td>', 'Way too small. I''m sure I''m not the first to mention it. Looks like it could be interesting but too hard to evaluate at this size.', '2006-01-04 18:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004208, 274402, 7322, '<td valign="top">Classic image of city life. I like the snow and the way the trees frame the main subject. Could wish for slightly warmer skin tones.</td>', 'Classic image of city life. I like the snow and the way the trees frame the main subject. Could wish for slightly warmer skin tones.', '2006-01-04 18:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004210, 275910, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice grainy image works for this challenge, IMO. I like the narrow, horizontal frame for this shot. Just wish it were a bit bigger (I know you probably used up your max on the width). Could wish for slightly more exposure in the foreground. I love the blurred train.</td>', 'Nice grainy image works for this challenge, IMO. I like the narrow, horizontal frame for this shot. Just wish it were a bit bigger (I know you probably used up your max on the width). Could wish for slightly more exposure in the foreground. I love the blurred train.', '2006-01-04 18:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004211, 276120, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, if a bit grainy and lackling in focus. Could be a bit more saturated in the reds and yellows, as well.</td>', 'Nice capture, if a bit grainy and lackling in focus. Could be a bit more saturated in the reds and yellows, as well.', '2006-01-04 18:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004214, 275018, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very interesting capture. Unusual choice of framing for this subject.For the most part I really like the blur. I kind of wish there were at least one person in fairly sharp focus. I''m not crazy about the really hot spot at the back left corner of the frame.</td>', 'Very interesting capture. Unusual choice of framing for this subject.For the most part I really like the blur. I kind of wish there were at least one person in fairly sharp focus. I''m not crazy about the really hot spot at the back left corner of the frame.', '2006-01-04 18:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004217, 276468, 7322, '<td valign="top">This could be an interesting shot but without people it is just kind of dull for me. The blur of headlights helps but in the end it isn''t quiote enough to engage me.</td>', 'This could be an interesting shot but without people it is just kind of dull for me. The blur of headlights helps but in the end it isn''t quiote enough to engage me.', '2006-01-04 18:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004222, 276094, 7322, '<td valign="top">A potentially interesting subject. What kind of ruins it for me is the long, blurry expanse of whatever that is in the foreground. I like the pole with all the flyers and the play of shadow on the planks.</td>', 'A potentially interesting subject. What kind of ruins it for me is the long, blurry expanse of whatever that is in the foreground. I like the pole with all the flyers and the play of shadow on the planks.', '2006-01-04 18:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004224, 275939, 34659, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous!  The deep, rich tones, the colorful lights, the busy composition, the motion everywhere - all scream a beautiful night of city life.  Perfect.</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous!  The deep, rich tones, the colorful lights, the busy composition, the motion everywhere - all scream a beautiful night of city life.  Perfect.', '2006-01-04 18:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004228, 275242, 34659, '<td valign="top">WOW...  Strong statement.  Love it.  Powerful image.  Great job.</td>', 'WOW...  Strong statement.  Love it.  Powerful image.  Great job.', '2006-01-04 18:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004231, 275236, 7322, '<td valign="top">Cute shot of this couple. I like the smile on the cabby (?). It is a bit overexposed in the background but I can see how that happened in trying to get the exposure of the couple right.</td>', 'Cute shot of this couple. I like the smile on the cabby (?). It is a bit overexposed in the background but I can see how that happened in trying to get the exposure of the couple right.', '2006-01-04 18:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004232, 276058, 34659, '<td valign="top">Spectacular capture!!!  WOW</td>', 'Spectacular capture!!!  WOW', '2006-01-04 18:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004234, 275767, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great capture!</td>', 'Great capture!', '2006-01-04 18:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004237, 274756, 34659, '<td valign="top">Tough to improve on this image in basic editing.  Outstanding job - beautifully composed and captured.</td>', 'Tough to improve on this image in basic editing.  Outstanding job - beautifully composed and captured.', '2006-01-04 18:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004240, 274393, 34659, '<td valign="top">WOW...  Stunningly beautiful.  Great job.</td>', 'WOW...  Stunningly beautiful.  Great job.', '2006-01-04 18:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004242, 276067, 7322, '<td valign="top">This has a rather timeless feel to it. It would be easy to attribute that to the sepia tone but I thin more it is the random capture of the huge crowd of people in the streets. I would like it quite a bit more if it were a bitter sharper in focus. It''s the kind of shot that a large format film camera captures so well because the great depth of field and the incredible sharpness allows you to really spend time perusing details and faces. With this exposure everything is a bit too grainy to really spend a lot of time with.</td>', 'This has a rather timeless feel to it. It would be easy to attribute that to the sepia tone but I thin more it is the random capture of the huge crowd of people in the streets. I would like it quite a bit more if it were a bitter sharper in focus. It''s the kind of shot that a large format film camera captures so well because the great depth of field and the incredible sharpness allows you to really spend time perusing details and faces. With this exposure everything is a bit too grainy to really spend a lot of time with.', '2006-01-04 18:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004247, 275950, 7322, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is really badly pixelated. It could be an interesting shot but the image quality is really so bad as to be distracting.</td>', 'Wow, this is really badly pixelated. It could be an interesting shot but the image quality is really so bad as to be distracting.', '2006-01-04 18:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004248, 274658, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful skyline. The image quality needs to be quite a bit better for me to really appreciate this shot though. I''m not a freak for super sharpness but with this type of image I think it is imperative.</td>', 'This is a beautiful skyline. The image quality needs to be quite a bit better for me to really appreciate this shot though. I''m not a freak for super sharpness but with this type of image I think it is imperative.', '2006-01-04 18:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004251, 276005, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a kind of dull view of this city. Perhaps a close-up of one of the older buildings from an unusual point of view?</td>', 'This is a kind of dull view of this city. Perhaps a close-up of one of the older buildings from an unusual point of view?', '2006-01-04 18:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004260, 274374, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is humorous but it seems to be more of a depcition of rural life than city life. The sign seems to be the main artistic statement (someone else''s work). I''m not a freak about graininess but this is a bit grainy even for my taste.</td>', 'This is humorous but it seems to be more of a depcition of rural life than city life. The sign seems to be the main artistic statement (someone else''s work). I''m not a freak about graininess but this is a bit grainy even for my taste.', '2006-01-04 18:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004264, 273797, 7322, '<td valign="top">Cool action capture but this strikes me as more suburban than city. It could be sharper in focus.</td>', 'Cool action capture but this strikes me as more suburban than city. It could be sharper in focus.', '2006-01-04 18:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004266, 276099, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the wide angle but this is ultimately kind of a boring capture.</td>', 'I like the wide angle but this is ultimately kind of a boring capture.', '2006-01-04 18:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004271, 273957, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is really murky and grainy. A huge portion of the frame is dominated by grainy blackness. I''m not really getting a feel for stained glass either.</td>', 'This is really murky and grainy. A huge portion of the frame is dominated by grainy blackness. I''m not really getting a feel for stained glass either.', '2006-01-04 18:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004274, 273455, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the news guy''s expression. I''m not sure whether I like the cropping out of the guy reading the paper or not. I do like that sort of spontaineous cropping but in this instance I think I''d like to see some of his face.</td>', 'Nice capture of the news guy''s expression. I''m not sure whether I like the cropping out of the guy reading the paper or not. I do like that sort of spontaineous cropping but in this instance I think I''d like to see some of his face.', '2006-01-04 18:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004276, 275068, 44607, '<td valign="top">10+:-)</td>', '10+:-)', '2006-01-04 18:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004277, 276065, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. A bit too contrasty and harsh for me. There needs to be more shadow and highlight detail instead of this extreme black and white. This is especially true for the man''s face---his features are nearly obliterated by shadow.</td>', 'Nice capture. A bit too contrasty and harsh for me. There needs to be more shadow and highlight detail instead of this extreme black and white. This is especially true for the man''s face---his features are nearly obliterated by shadow.', '2006-01-04 18:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004280, 275441, 7322, '<td valign="top">I kind of like this in an abstract way.The high contrast black and white helps.  Ultimately though, I''m too aware that it is kind of a boring view of a satelite dish and an ugly apartment building.</td>', 'I kind of like this in an abstract way.The high contrast black and white helps.  Ultimately though, I''m too aware that it is kind of a boring view of a satelite dish and an ugly apartment building.', '2006-01-04 18:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004281, 275940, 7322, '<td valign="top">Too small and soft focus to evaluate.</td>', 'Too small and soft focus to evaluate.', '2006-01-04 18:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004283, 276298, 7322, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot of an unusual scene ruined by bad focus.</td>', 'Interesting shot of an unusual scene ruined by bad focus.', '2006-01-04 18:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004287, 273816, 7322, '<td valign="top">For such a solemn subject, I wish you hadn''t chosen a shot in which one of the subjects appears to be adjusting a wedgie. This could be nice exept for that and the rather fuzzy focus.</td>', 'For such a solemn subject, I wish you hadn''t chosen a shot in which one of the subjects appears to be adjusting a wedgie. This could be nice exept for that and the rather fuzzy focus.', '2006-01-04 18:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004289, 274756, 7322, '<td valign="top">This might be more effective for me if it actually depicted some life (people, pigeons, anything). I think this could have benefited from including the entire fountain instead of cropping it at the top. This looks a bit cramped to me.</td>', 'This might be more effective for me if it actually depicted some life (people, pigeons, anything). I think this could have benefited from including the entire fountain instead of cropping it at the top. This looks a bit cramped to me.', '2006-01-04 18:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004293, 273556, 7322, '<td valign="top">Good possibilities but ultimately this is a ho-hum capture for me. There really isn''t anything that draws my interest. The focus needs to be much sharper (blurring of movement is okay but the stationary objects need to be nice and crisp).</td>', 'Good possibilities but ultimately this is a ho-hum capture for me. There really isn''t anything that draws my interest. The focus needs to be much sharper (blurring of movement is okay but the stationary objects need to be nice and crisp).', '2006-01-04 18:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004298, 274393, 49999, '<td valign="top">Excellent Shot, Excellent Composition, Excellent Score - 10</td>', 'Excellent Shot, Excellent Composition, Excellent Score - 10', '2006-01-04 18:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004353, 273403, 25553, '<td valign="top">nice crop dont see the conection with city life clearly and the softness is a bit distracting</td>', 'nice crop dont see the conection with city life clearly and the softness is a bit distracting', '2006-01-04 19:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004363, 275972, 25553, '<td valign="top">i see a lot of city.. but i cant really see the life.. anywho the tilt is a bit distracting..</td>', 'i see a lot of city.. but i cant really see the life.. anywho the tilt is a bit distracting..', '2006-01-04 19:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004377, 276065, 25553, '<td valign="top">this is a nice image but both of your extremes are loosing a lot of detail.. it seems like a ND filter couldve done the trick..</td>', 'this is a nice image but both of your extremes are loosing a lot of detail.. it seems like a ND filter couldve done the trick..', '2006-01-04 19:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004387, 274201, 50680, '<td valign="top">Looks like a lot of action at only 10 MPH.<br/>The GPS is a nice touch.<br/>I like your photo a lot. I think it captures the hussle and bussle<br/>of the city in contrast to the calm cabin environment of the vehicle.<br/>Good job.</td>', 'Looks like a lot of action at only 10 MPH.The GPS is a nice touch.I like your photo a lot. I think it captures the hussle and bussleof the city in contrast to the calm cabin environment of the vehicle.Good job.', '2006-01-04 19:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004393, 274374, 25553, '<td valign="top">this doesnt seem like city life to me.. more like country bunken life..:]</td>', 'this doesnt seem like city life to me.. more like country bunken life..:]', '2006-01-04 19:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004404, 274393, 46097, '<td valign="top">lovely. best I''ve seen all morning, since voting for the past 15 mins.</td>', 'lovely. best I''ve seen all morning, since voting for the past 15 mins.', '2006-01-04 19:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004408, 276319, 50680, '<td valign="top">nice, I like the atmospheric conditions you captured</td>', 'nice, I like the atmospheric conditions you captured', '2006-01-04 19:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004411, 273403, 46097, '<td valign="top">cute subject, nice enough shot, but I have to say, I dont see the relation to the challenge.</td>', 'cute subject, nice enough shot, but I have to say, I dont see the relation to the challenge.', '2006-01-04 19:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004425, 276466, 50680, '<td valign="top">Very creative, really nice job</td>', 'Very creative, really nice job', '2006-01-04 19:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004430, 276279, 25553, '<td valign="top">latte? the corners seems to have a bit of pincushion going on and it distracts from your subject..</td>', 'latte? the corners seems to have a bit of pincushion going on and it distracts from your subject..', '2006-01-04 19:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004439, 275286, 25553, '<td valign="top">this says city life.. but why is everyone walking away from you?</td>', 'this says city life.. but why is everyone walking away from you?', '2006-01-04 19:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004445, 276389, 25553, '<td valign="top">sweet grain! i like the selective desat..</td>', 'sweet grain! i like the selective desat..', '2006-01-04 19:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2004447, 275767, 50680, '<td valign="top">It''s like a large red artery feeding a hungry city.<br/>Very nice. I looked at your photo for a long time.</td>', 'It''s like a large red artery feeding a hungry city.Very nice. I looked at your photo for a long time.', '2006-01-04 19:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
