(2004598, 275036, 49007, '<td valign="top">Challenge<br/>- Relevant to the Challenge? Yes<br/>- Is subject unique (vs. unoriginal or rehashed)? Yes<br/> <br/>Compostion<br/>- Good or Bad? How can it be fixed? I might take a bit off the left side, just before you hit the P in Police. Nothing there that adds to the image.<br/>- Is there anything missing? My eye wants to see more of the sign on the right side.<br/>- Good use of Depth of Field? Yes<br/> <br/>Lighting <br/>- Good use of light? Yes<br/>- Are there any over-blown highlights? No<br/>- Good use of shadows? Yes<br/>- Are there any overly dark shadows? No<br/> <br/>Aesthetics/Artistic Appeal:<br/>- What is my reaction or feelings? Although there are no people (read as life) the image give a sense of expectation. There will be activity later. It''s safe for your wives, daughters, and sisters now, but it''ll be dark soon...<br/></td>', 'Challenge- Relevant to the Challenge? Yes- Is subject unique (vs. unoriginal or rehashed)? Yes Compostion- Good or Bad? How can it be fixed? I might take a bit off the left side, just before you hit the P in Police. Nothing there that adds to the image.- Is there anything missing? My eye wants to see more of the sign on the right side.- Good use of Depth of Field? Yes Lighting - Good use of light? Yes- Are there any over-blown highlights? No- Good use of shadows? Yes- Are there any overly dark shadows? No Aesthetics/Artistic Appeal:- What is my reaction or feelings? Although there are no people (read as life) the image give a sense of expectation. There will be activity later. It''s safe for your wives, daughters, and sisters now, but it''ll be dark soon...', '2006-01-04 20:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
