(2004626, 276241, 49007, '<td valign="top">Challenge<br/>- Relevant to the Challenge? Yes<br/>- Is subject unique (vs. unoriginal or rehashed)? Yes<br/> <br/>Compostion<br/>- Good or Bad? How can it be fixed? Good, however the line of cars parked on the left is a bit distracting since they are not straight. I''m curios where you were that you could get a shot from 30 feet above street level. If it were a ''bridge'' I''d think the opposite side of the strret would work bettter.<br/>- Is there anything missing? More liveliness. It has a very lonely feel to it with the blurred cars speeding away. Maybe that''s what you were going for.<br/>- Good use of Depth of Field? Yes<br/> <br/>Lighting <br/>- Good use of light? Yes<br/>- Are there any over-blown highlights? No<br/>- Are there any overly dark shadows? No<br/> <br/>Aesthetics/Artistic Appeal:<br/>- What is my reaction or feelings? As I said it feels very lonely. Not quite my sense of Citylife, but overall I like the image.</td>', 'Challenge- Relevant to the Challenge? Yes- Is subject unique (vs. unoriginal or rehashed)? Yes Compostion- Good or Bad? How can it be fixed? Good, however the line of cars parked on the left is a bit distracting since they are not straight. I''m curios where you were that you could get a shot from 30 feet above street level. If it were a ''bridge'' I''d think the opposite side of the strret would work bettter.- Is there anything missing? More liveliness. It has a very lonely feel to it with the blurred cars speeding away. Maybe that''s what you were going for.- Good use of Depth of Field? Yes Lighting - Good use of light? Yes- Are there any over-blown highlights? No- Are there any overly dark shadows? No Aesthetics/Artistic Appeal:- What is my reaction or feelings? As I said it feels very lonely. Not quite my sense of Citylife, but overall I like the image.', '2006-01-04 20:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
