(2004658, 276367, 49007, '<td valign="top">Challenge<br/>- Relevant to the Challenge? Yes<br/>- Is subject unique (vs. unoriginal or rehashed)? Yes<br/> <br/>Compostion<br/>- Good or Bad? How can it be fixed?  Good It shows the dark side of citylife. Things that people don''t want to think about.<br/>- Good use of Depth of Field? I think a shallower DOF would work to make the buiding at the far end of the alley less sharp.<br/> <br/>Lighting <br/>- Good use of light? Yes<br/>- Are there any over-blown highlights? Yes<br/>- Good use of shadows? Yes. The add to the dark nature of the image.<br/>- Are there any overly dark shadows? No<br/> <br/>Aesthetics/Artistic Appeal:<br/>- What is my reaction or feelings?  I like the image because of the unique viewpoint. It''s a part of citylife that most people avoid. It''s dirty. It''s scary. It''s the city.</td>', 'Challenge- Relevant to the Challenge? Yes- Is subject unique (vs. unoriginal or rehashed)? Yes Compostion- Good or Bad? How can it be fixed?  Good It shows the dark side of citylife. Things that people don''t want to think about.- Good use of Depth of Field? I think a shallower DOF would work to make the buiding at the far end of the alley less sharp. Lighting - Good use of light? Yes- Are there any over-blown highlights? Yes- Good use of shadows? Yes. The add to the dark nature of the image.- Are there any overly dark shadows? No Aesthetics/Artistic Appeal:- What is my reaction or feelings?  I like the image because of the unique viewpoint. It''s a part of citylife that most people avoid. It''s dirty. It''s scary. It''s the city.', '2006-01-04 20:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
