(2004691, 275910, 49007, '<td valign="top">Challenge<br/>- Relevant to the Challenge? Yes<br/>- Is subject unique (vs. unoriginal or rehashed)? Yes<br/> <br/>Compostion<br/>- Good or Bad? How can it be fixed? Needs a little height to it.<br/>- Is there anything that should be removed? The shadow behind the woman on the on the left side is distracting.<br/>- Good use of Depth of Field? Yes<br/> <br/>Lighting <br/>- Good use of light? No. It a bit too dark (yes I know subways are that way) the shadows are blocked-up, while the train is blown out.<br/> <br/>Aesthetics/Artistic Appeal:<br/>- What is my reaction or feelings? The image needs a little punch, but it shows people going about their daily routines -- Citylife.</td>', 'Challenge- Relevant to the Challenge? Yes- Is subject unique (vs. unoriginal or rehashed)? Yes Compostion- Good or Bad? How can it be fixed? Needs a little height to it.- Is there anything that should be removed? The shadow behind the woman on the on the left side is distracting.- Good use of Depth of Field? Yes Lighting - Good use of light? No. It a bit too dark (yes I know subways are that way) the shadows are blocked-up, while the train is blown out. Aesthetics/Artistic Appeal:- What is my reaction or feelings? The image needs a little punch, but it shows people going about their daily routines -- Citylife.', '2006-01-04 20:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
