(2005015, 275286, 1647, '<td valign="top">I like this shot - there is certainly plenty of traffic.  As a suggestion try cropping the sky entirely out of the shot - because it''s so bright it draws your attention away from the "cars" unnecessarily.  A different crop might make this photo more "focused" on the traffic.  Good work though.</td>', 'I like this shot - there is certainly plenty of traffic.  As a suggestion try cropping the sky entirely out of the shot - because it''s so bright it draws your attention away from the "cars" unnecessarily.  A different crop might make this photo more "focused" on the traffic.  Good work though.', '2006-01-04 21:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
