(2005026, 276418, 1647, '<td valign="top">Witty title, but the photo doesn''t seem terribly relevant to "City Life".  The trees make it look like a boat ramp in the countryside.  Technically the photo is fine - colour, sharpness, contrast all good.</td>', 'Witty title, but the photo doesn''t seem terribly relevant to "City Life".  The trees make it look like a boat ramp in the countryside.  Technically the photo is fine - colour, sharpness, contrast all good.', '2006-01-04 22:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
