(2005116, 276108, 35602, '<td valign="top">I think the image should have been simplified.  I think I liked the right side of the image best.  I know you were doing a contrast of the two, but it didn''t give my eye a definite resting spot.</td>', 'I think the image should have been simplified.  I think I liked the right side of the image best.  I know you were doing a contrast of the two, but it didn''t give my eye a definite resting spot.', '2006-01-04 22:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
