(2005122, 273949, 35602, '<td valign="top">The use of black and white was good.  Thought it could have been a little clearer, even if it was just on the sidewalk, to give the image one definite well focused area.</td>', 'The use of black and white was good.  Thought it could have been a little clearer, even if it was just on the sidewalk, to give the image one definite well focused area.', '2006-01-04 22:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005123, 274788, 48967, '<td valign="top">Such a quiet lonely building and busy busy people... I like the colors. The compo is great too.</td>', 'Such a quiet lonely building and busy busy people... I like the colors. The compo is great too.', '2006-01-04 22:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005127, 274492, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic.  Nice capture of the profile, with just a hint of color line to define the features.</td>', 'Very dramatic.  Nice capture of the profile, with just a hint of color line to define the features.', '2006-01-04 22:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005129, 275215, 48967, '<td valign="top">IMPRESSIVE I must say.<br/>So well to capture it without those movin'' thingies and with perfect colors, must''ve been hard in a cloudy darky day... Really, I''m impressed. Great! 10!!</td>', 'IMPRESSIVE I must say.So well to capture it without those movin'' thingies and with perfect colors, must''ve been hard in a cloudy darky day... Really, I''m impressed. Great! 10!!', '2006-01-04 22:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005132, 276098, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very good use of shallow dof in the background lights.  Thought the capture of the reflection in the sunglasses really defined that this was a city shot.  Just a really good photo on all levels.  Very GQ.</td>', 'Very good use of shallow dof in the background lights.  Thought the capture of the reflection in the sunglasses really defined that this was a city shot.  Just a really good photo on all levels.  Very GQ.', '2006-01-04 22:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005135, 276298, 35602, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.</td>', 'Hmmm.', '2006-01-04 22:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2005137, 275286, 48967, '<td valign="top">Busy place, huh? It looks nice even thou there are a lot of colors and situations... It''s a good photo, but I would''ve liked to see a focal point, but hey, the challenge is about city life and this shot represents it!</td>', 'Busy place, huh? It looks nice even thou there are a lot of colors and situations... It''s a good photo, but I would''ve liked to see a focal point, but hey, the challenge is about city life and this shot represents it!', '2006-01-04 22:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
