(2005143, 274961, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very good shot.  The use of monotone here really brought out the mundane nature of the picture.  The woman is just like one I saw in New York last month.  I was really surprised how many disabled or otherwise unusual shaped people I saw there.  Liked this one so much.</td>', 'Very good shot.  The use of monotone here really brought out the mundane nature of the picture.  The woman is just like one I saw in New York last month.  I was really surprised how many disabled or otherwise unusual shaped people I saw there.  Liked this one so much.', '2006-01-04 22:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
