(2005182, 274613, 35602, '<td valign="top">Great saturation of color.  Liked the capture of the sprays of water, too.  The only thing is it seemed a bit to digitized, especially noticable in the tree leaves.  I find that sometimes taking at a lower iso and smaller file, (maybe even 1 VGA) might clear up some of the digitization that occurs during compression.</td>', 'Great saturation of color.  Liked the capture of the sprays of water, too.  The only thing is it seemed a bit to digitized, especially noticable in the tree leaves.  I find that sometimes taking at a lower iso and smaller file, (maybe even 1 VGA) might clear up some of the digitization that occurs during compression.', '2006-01-04 22:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
