(2005218, 276120, 7485, '<td valign="top">The back-lighting is interesting, but it leaves the guy''s face in the dark. Also the DOF is a bit awkward, neither deep enough to contain both guys nor shallow enough to isolate any particular depth layer. (And just to be nit-picky, there''s nothing uniquely American about firemen being heroic.)</td>', 'The back-lighting is interesting, but it leaves the guy''s face in the dark. Also the DOF is a bit awkward, neither deep enough to contain both guys nor shallow enough to isolate any particular depth layer. (And just to be nit-picky, there''s nothing uniquely American about firemen being heroic.)', '2006-01-04 22:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
