(2006057, 276277, 31443, '<td valign="top">Lack of contrast and shadow makes this image rather flat, I like the idae though and this is a typical city life scenery these days.</td>', 'Lack of contrast and shadow makes this image rather flat, I like the idae though and this is a typical city life scenery these days.', '2006-01-05 06:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006198, 276094, 13467, '<td valign="top">Great photo!<br/>Bystro :)</td>', 'Great photo!Bystro :)', '2006-01-05 07:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006267, 275933, 40820, '<td valign="top">love the color tones of this pic and the mood it conveys...</td>', 'love the color tones of this pic and the mood it conveys...', '2006-01-05 08:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006271, 276411, 40355, '<td valign="top">Love the star effect, but the open foreground is a little bland.  You could maybe have cropped in on the busier backgroung.</td>', 'Love the star effect, but the open foreground is a little bland.  You could maybe have cropped in on the busier backgroung.', '2006-01-05 08:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006273, 274961, 40355, '<td valign="top">This is a really emotive shot, but IMO you could have filled more of the frame with the woman, and less with sidewalk, trees, etc.</td>', 'This is a really emotive shot, but IMO you could have filled more of the frame with the woman, and less with sidewalk, trees, etc.', '2006-01-05 08:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006274, 276157, 40355, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors in this, how each building is different.  All the masts and lines in the front make it somewhat busy, which could be reduced if more of the first boat could be seen.</td>', 'I really like the colors in this, how each building is different.  All the masts and lines in the front make it somewhat busy, which could be reduced if more of the first boat could be seen.', '2006-01-05 08:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006275, 274492, 40355, '<td valign="top">Hmm...doesn''t strike me so much as city life as it does a good portrait shot.  I see the connection, I just feel it has more potential in another catagory.  Love the reflected light on his face, and the OOF fire in the background.</td>', 'Hmm...doesn''t strike me so much as city life as it does a good portrait shot.  I see the connection, I just feel it has more potential in another catagory.  Love the reflected light on his face, and the OOF fire in the background.', '2006-01-05 08:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006276, 274114, 40355, '<td valign="top">Awful small....</td>', 'Awful small....', '2006-01-05 08:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006278, 276348, 40355, '<td valign="top">This is a neat approach to the challenge.</td>', 'This is a neat approach to the challenge.', '2006-01-05 08:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006280, 276316, 40355, '<td valign="top">Great portrait.  Too bad this is only basic editing, as some dodge/burn could have made this even better!</td>', 'Great portrait.  Too bad this is only basic editing, as some dodge/burn could have made this even better!', '2006-01-05 08:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006281, 276105, 40355, '<td valign="top">Neat perspective!</td>', 'Neat perspective!', '2006-01-05 08:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006282, 276121, 40355, '<td valign="top">Good choice for B&amp;W, and I like the washout effect at the top.  9</td>', 'Good choice for B&W, and I like the washout effect at the top.  9', '2006-01-05 08:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006283, 274788, 40355, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...blew out the bottom highlights, which makes it rather distracting.</td>', 'Hmmm...blew out the bottom highlights, which makes it rather distracting.', '2006-01-05 08:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006284, 274721, 40355, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this myself, in another city.  Well shot, except it sorta'' bugs me that you cut off his one foot.</td>', 'I''ve seen this myself, in another city.  Well shot, except it sorta'' bugs me that you cut off his one foot.', '2006-01-05 08:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006285, 274721, 40820, '<td valign="top">classic capture!</td>', 'classic capture!', '2006-01-05 08:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006287, 276448, 40355, '<td valign="top">This is really, really good.  I love the sepia tones, it has a vintage feel to it.  Just very well shot.   10</td>', 'This is really, really good.  I love the sepia tones, it has a vintage feel to it.  Just very well shot.   10', '2006-01-05 08:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006289, 275359, 40355, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Heck of a capture!</td>', 'Wow.  Heck of a capture!', '2006-01-05 08:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006294, 276404, 6202, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful and crisp.  Only fault I find with it is the van makes you realize this isn''t 1940.  But seriously nit picking aside I really like this.  I wasn''t sure where this photo was from but first thing I thought of was Richmond and Raliegh, then I noticed the Fells Point Sign and I know I''m not to far off, its a very nice capture of the southern charm.  I''m still expecting to see one of the Walton''s come out a store. 10 from me for capturing so much charm.</td>', 'Simply beautiful and crisp.  Only fault I find with it is the van makes you realize this isn''t 1940.  But seriously nit picking aside I really like this.  I wasn''t sure where this photo was from but first thing I thought of was Richmond and Raliegh, then I noticed the Fells Point Sign and I know I''m not to far off, its a very nice capture of the southern charm.  I''m still expecting to see one of the Walton''s come out a store. 10 from me for capturing so much charm.', '2006-01-05 08:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006299, 276467, 40355, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model, beautiful portrait, but IMO, it''s a little bit of a stretch.  Seeing this, I wouldn''t think "city life".   However, since I really like it, and it''s so well done, I can''t bring myself to score it lower  :)   10</td>', 'Beautiful model, beautiful portrait, but IMO, it''s a little bit of a stretch.  Seeing this, I wouldn''t think "city life".   However, since I really like it, and it''s so well done, I can''t bring myself to score it lower  :)   10', '2006-01-05 08:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006301, 274393, 40355, '<td valign="top">A little over exposed, IMO</td>', 'A little over exposed, IMO', '2006-01-05 08:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
