(2006637, 274344, 40355, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t strike me as a city picture at all.  Sorry, but foxes are one of those creatures you find more in the rural areas, and that aside, there''s nothing in the photo to indicate that this is a city.  If there were buildings, people, etc, then maybe it would work.  But this shot could be anywhere - behind that fence could be the Arizona desert as much as it could by NYC.  (It is however a well composed photo, and I like it - good color, good focus)</td>', 'This doesn''t strike me as a city picture at all.  Sorry, but foxes are one of those creatures you find more in the rural areas, and that aside, there''s nothing in the photo to indicate that this is a city.  If there were buildings, people, etc, then maybe it would work.  But this shot could be anywhere - behind that fence could be the Arizona desert as much as it could by NYC.  (It is however a well composed photo, and I like it - good color, good focus)', '2006-01-05 10:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006645, 275018, 32084, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot.  I love the artistic feel, but I am struggling to determine what it is.  For me it would help if there were at least one small area where I could figure out what was going on and then the rest could be this artistic feel.</td>', 'Very interesting shot.  I love the artistic feel, but I am struggling to determine what it is.  For me it would help if there were at least one small area where I could figure out what was going on and then the rest could be this artistic feel.', '2006-01-05 10:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
