(2006692, 275099, 49489, '<td valign="top">niagara falls?  beautiful!!</td>', 'niagara falls?  beautiful!!', '2006-01-05 10:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006710, 275334, 37719, '<td valign="top">(my original comment)Where is the ''City Life?''<br/>Ammended comment:  The challenge was to take a picture of city life.  Although to you this is what you have to deal with in the city, it is your experience.  No one can interpret your experience.  There is nothing to even indicate this is in a city.  Just pipe ends - no traffic patterns around them (foot paths to show they are ''in the way''); no indication of city and in fact looks like it could be out in the woods somewhere with the weeds and growth.<br/> <br/>Again, it may be something you personally have to deal with so in your mind this is a good fit for the challenge.  But in reality no one here knows you have to deal with this and when thinking of city life, this just doesn''t show it.</td>', '(my original comment)Where is the ''City Life?''Ammended comment:  The challenge was to take a picture of city life.  Although to you this is what you have to deal with in the city, it is your experience.  No one can interpret your experience.  There is nothing to even indicate this is in a city.  Just pipe ends - no traffic patterns around them (foot paths to show they are ''in the way''); no indication of city and in fact looks like it could be out in the woods somewhere with the weeds and growth. Again, it may be something you personally have to deal with so in your mind this is a good fit for the challenge.  But in reality no one here knows you have to deal with this and when thinking of city life, this just doesn''t show it.', '2006-01-05 10:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006711, 274160, 40192, '<td valign="top">amazing colors. 8</td>', 'amazing colors. 8', '2006-01-05 10:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006720, 276215, 40192, '<td valign="top">this picture was going to be better if you had used a tripod</td>', 'this picture was going to be better if you had used a tripod', '2006-01-05 10:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006726, 276067, 18207, '<td valign="top">I was looking for a long time for an image that fits the challenge. (This is how I used to start voting usually.) Now, after looking at many shots, I found it, and I found a good quality one. Yes, this is really about city life in theme, composition, color, feeling. Unfortunately it''s so hard for me to read the banner, but that''s all I don''t like about this shot. Grats.</td>', 'I was looking for a long time for an image that fits the challenge. (This is how I used to start voting usually.) Now, after looking at many shots, I found it, and I found a good quality one. Yes, this is really about city life in theme, composition, color, feeling. Unfortunately it''s so hard for me to read the banner, but that''s all I don''t like about this shot. Grats.', '2006-01-05 10:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006736, 275939, 18207, '<td valign="top">This shutter speed doesn''t really work for me. I''d prefer either a much longer or much slower exposition (with the proper compensation of course). It''s also a bit underexposed for my taste. What I really like is the theme itself.</td>', 'This shutter speed doesn''t really work for me. I''d prefer either a much longer or much slower exposition (with the proper compensation of course). It''s also a bit underexposed for my taste. What I really like is the theme itself.', '2006-01-05 10:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006743, 275334, 18207, '<td valign="top">Where''s "city life"? I know, I know... city upgrades or new homes for the less fortunate ones. But still, I miss the story. Technical side: it seems the dynamic range of your camera can''t handle this composition with bright sky in the top left corner and deep shadows in the pipes.</td>', 'Where''s "city life"? I know, I know... city upgrades or new homes for the less fortunate ones. But still, I miss the story. Technical side: it seems the dynamic range of your camera can''t handle this composition with bright sky in the top left corner and deep shadows in the pipes.', '2006-01-05 11:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006787, 276363, 45790, '<td valign="top">I would have hoped for bolder lighting on the buildings -- really muted colors.</td>', 'I would have hoped for bolder lighting on the buildings -- really muted colors.', '2006-01-05 11:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006790, 276268, 45790, '<td valign="top">Spectacular shot!</td>', 'Spectacular shot!', '2006-01-05 11:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006796, 276411, 45790, '<td valign="top">Looks like a dull city -- no traffic, no people, little color.</td>', 'Looks like a dull city -- no traffic, no people, little color.', '2006-01-05 11:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006800, 275339, 45790, '<td valign="top">Dull, uninteresting subject that isn''t necessarily in a city.</td>', 'Dull, uninteresting subject that isn''t necessarily in a city.', '2006-01-05 11:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006806, 275359, 45790, '<td valign="top">I feel fireworks are more effective set against a dark background. Perhaps a contrast adjustment?</td>', 'I feel fireworks are more effective set against a dark background. Perhaps a contrast adjustment?', '2006-01-05 11:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006809, 275073, 31443, '<td valign="top">Cute outfit for kitty :) nice image too!</td>', 'Cute outfit for kitty :) nice image too!', '2006-01-05 11:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006810, 275940, 45790, '<td valign="top">It''s a good idea to submit photos that take full advantage of the maximum 640 pixel dimension. It''s hard to judge small pictures.</td>', 'It''s a good idea to submit photos that take full advantage of the maximum 640 pixel dimension. It''s hard to judge small pictures.', '2006-01-05 11:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006813, 276098, 45790, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection as well as background.</td>', 'Nice reflection as well as background.', '2006-01-05 11:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006819, 275036, 45790, '<td valign="top">Great to get the police car in the shot! B&amp;W works very well here.</td>', 'Great to get the police car in the shot! B&W works very well here.', '2006-01-05 11:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006821, 275318, 45790, '<td valign="top">This could be anywhere, doesn''t convey city.</td>', 'This could be anywhere, doesn''t convey city.', '2006-01-05 11:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006851, 276431, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and lights, brighter levels, a little cropping or a touch more DOF might have helped as it feels like there is too much out-of-focus foreground.</td>', 'Nice colors and lights, brighter levels, a little cropping or a touch more DOF might have helped as it feels like there is too much out-of-focus foreground.', '2006-01-05 11:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006853, 275420, 35804, '<td valign="top">I really like this alot...My only wish is that it were a little larger...the max 640 allowed by DPC...a very interesting image none the less.</td>', 'I really like this alot...My only wish is that it were a little larger...the max 640 allowed by DPC...a very interesting image none the less.', '2006-01-05 11:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006894, 275538, 49480, '<td valign="top">Whoa, this actually freaked me out when I saw it because the rig still looks like it''s moving.</td>', 'Whoa, this actually freaked me out when I saw it because the rig still looks like it''s moving.', '2006-01-05 12:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006943, 273342, 18073, '<td valign="top">An interesting attempt but personally I think there''s too much dead space at the top and bottom of the image.</td>', 'An interesting attempt but personally I think there''s too much dead space at the top and bottom of the image.', '2006-01-05 12:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006951, 274980, 18073, '<td valign="top">This could have been so much better had that walkway/girder not split the inage in half.  Obviously you can''t avoid this but perhaps a different composition would hav reduced the effect.  I think part of the problem is that the girder gives the impression of a sloping horizon.  Still, a nice shot and well done for climbing up there to get the shot!</td>', 'This could have been so much better had that walkway/girder not split the inage in half.  Obviously you can''t avoid this but perhaps a different composition would hav reduced the effect.  I think part of the problem is that the girder gives the impression of a sloping horizon.  Still, a nice shot and well done for climbing up there to get the shot!', '2006-01-05 12:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006960, 274492, 18073, '<td valign="top">Great composition and use of the light.  Well done!</td>', 'Great composition and use of the light.  Well done!', '2006-01-05 12:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006970, 275855, 18073, '<td valign="top">I think the biggest thing that holds this shot back is the flat light and lack of contrast.  I think a little tinkering with curves would bring out the colour and detail out and make a big difference to this photo</td>', 'I think the biggest thing that holds this shot back is the flat light and lack of contrast.  I think a little tinkering with curves would bring out the colour and detail out and make a big difference to this photo', '2006-01-05 12:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006973, 276268, 33672, '<td valign="top">Best of the comp so far IMO. Great tones and colors</td>', 'Best of the comp so far IMO. Great tones and colors', '2006-01-05 12:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006975, 276164, 18073, '<td valign="top">Nice reportage style shot and I also like your composition.  Looks like it has been a little overdone on the neatimage or something as it looks kind of smooth or plasticy, but I think that this helps in this instance.  It gives the image a kind of chrismas card feel to the photo.<br/> <br/>I like it!</td>', 'Nice reportage style shot and I also like your composition.  Looks like it has been a little overdone on the neatimage or something as it looks kind of smooth or plasticy, but I think that this helps in this instance.  It gives the image a kind of chrismas card feel to the photo. I like it!', '2006-01-05 12:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006978, 276467, 33672, '<td valign="top">Like the idea. A bit less overexposure and stray hairs woulsd make this a ribbon contender, still a high scorer for me.</td>', 'Like the idea. A bit less overexposure and stray hairs woulsd make this a ribbon contender, still a high scorer for me.', '2006-01-05 12:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006980, 275767, 18073, '<td valign="top">Cracking effort and interesting composition.  I think that the sky could have done with a little burning in tho.  Still a nice job tho, well done!</td>', 'Cracking effort and interesting composition.  I think that the sky could have done with a little burning in tho.  Still a nice job tho, well done!', '2006-01-05 12:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006983, 276045, 18073, '<td valign="top">Great shot, love the high contrast here which really makes this shot jump out of the screen.  Like this one a lot, well done!</td>', 'Great shot, love the high contrast here which really makes this shot jump out of the screen.  Like this one a lot, well done!', '2006-01-05 12:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2006984, 275933, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great theme. As a city person I can relate to the emotion. tones are freat but the overexposed light on the trees detract IMO.</td>', 'Great theme. As a city person I can relate to the emotion. tones are freat but the overexposed light on the trees detract IMO.', '2006-01-05 12:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2007003, 274980, 47377, '<td valign="top">is it just me? dis picture makes me feel slightle sea-sick. I think it might be something with the perspective... not sure. I like the idea and everything though...</td>', 'is it just me? dis picture makes me feel slightle sea-sick. I think it might be something with the perspective... not sure. I like the idea and everything though...', '2006-01-05 13:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2007007, 275742, 30841, '<td valign="top">This guy just evokes Cleveland all the way. The image would have been great cropped. The only way this much background can work with the shot is using the rule of thirds ie shifting the subject to the left or right margin. This image would be 50% better if the cropping was flush with the left of the light pole, cut off at the knees, and flush with the top of the wall to hide the parking lot. Just my opinion. Still deserves a 7.</td>', 'This guy just evokes Cleveland all the way. The image would have been great cropped. The only way this much background can work with the shot is using the rule of thirds ie shifting the subject to the left or right margin. This image would be 50% better if the cropping was flush with the left of the light pole, cut off at the knees, and flush with the top of the wall to hide the parking lot. Just my opinion. Still deserves a 7.', '2006-01-05 13:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2007042, 275933, 50695, '<td valign="top">this evokes a world, and thus a life.</td>', 'this evokes a world, and thus a life.', '2006-01-05 13:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2007043, 274344, 50695, '<td valign="top">ah, it''s not just people who have lives!</td>', 'ah, it''s not just people who have lives!', '2006-01-05 13:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2007045, 275242, 31597, '<td valign="top">this images is amazing!  my favorite photo of this contest</td>', 'this images is amazing!  my favorite photo of this contest', '2006-01-05 13:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2007046, 274158, 50695, '<td valign="top">the abstraction still allows for a sense of "life"</td>', 'the abstraction still allows for a sense of "life"', '2006-01-05 13:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2007055, 273556, 18080, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge to a tee. Focus is a little soft.<br/>Good luck</td>', 'Fits the challenge to a tee. Focus is a little soft.Good luck', '2006-01-05 13:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2007056, 276362, 50695, '<td valign="top">ah seeing life through death. I''ll buy that.</td>', 'ah seeing life through death. I''ll buy that.', '2006-01-05 13:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2007059, 276268, 50695, '<td valign="top">wow this looks so vast, yet it reminds me of looking at life through a microscope, being so far removed from it.</td>', 'wow this looks so vast, yet it reminds me of looking at life through a microscope, being so far removed from it.', '2006-01-05 13:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
