(2007228, 276058, 16950, '<td valign="top">I really like the picture.  The angles of the church and colors grabbed my attention.  Upping the f/ some, may have eliminated your purple fringing on the lights, though can be hard to do with a night shot.</td>', 'I really like the picture.  The angles of the church and colors grabbed my attention.  Upping the f/ some, may have eliminated your purple fringing on the lights, though can be hard to do with a night shot.', '2006-01-05 14:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
