(2008275, 275215, 41802, '<td valign="top">Wow great shot, I love to be able to see Paris from my computer here in Colorado. I love the angle.</td>', 'Wow great shot, I love to be able to see Paris from my computer here in Colorado. I love the angle.', '2006-01-05 20:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2008286, 274114, 19831, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge. I do see city life here. The shot seems kind of busy though, which could work, but I find my eye not finding something solid to hold my attention and draw me in. Seems like focus could be sharper here, it is hard to tell with the small size. I''m sure you are getting lots of comments about the size :-) It really makes a big difference, larger shows off so much more detail. There is a great tutorial in the ''Learn'' section here on the site about sizing and entering photos for challenges. I would say you''ve got a good eye for subject, just need to work on some technicals and composition.</td>', 'Fits the challenge. I do see city life here. The shot seems kind of busy though, which could work, but I find my eye not finding something solid to hold my attention and draw me in. Seems like focus could be sharper here, it is hard to tell with the small size. I''m sure you are getting lots of comments about the size :-) It really makes a big difference, larger shows off so much more detail. There is a great tutorial in the ''Learn'' section here on the site about sizing and entering photos for challenges. I would say you''ve got a good eye for subject, just need to work on some technicals and composition.', '2006-01-05 20:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2008298, 275087, 35804, '<td valign="top">...those wacky Mummers...</td>', '...those wacky Mummers...', '2006-01-05 20:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2008323, 276277, 19831, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. I think I see the idea here and how it meets the challenge, however I can understand how some could miss it. The composition is good, a fine use of repetitive patterns. It seems like your focus could be a bit sharper. That and some levels tweaking could strengthen the presentation here IMO. I think some brightened lights and deeper darks could increase the overall tonal range and maybe bring out more detail and engage the viewer stronger.</td>', 'Interesting shot. I think I see the idea here and how it meets the challenge, however I can understand how some could miss it. The composition is good, a fine use of repetitive patterns. It seems like your focus could be a bit sharper. That and some levels tweaking could strengthen the presentation here IMO. I think some brightened lights and deeper darks could increase the overall tonal range and maybe bring out more detail and engage the viewer stronger.', '2006-01-05 20:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2008357, 275306, 40217, '<td valign="top">I like this, but I would have done a tighter crop on the right, to exclude the piece of trash on the steps. My eyes are drawn to that and it''s distracting.</td>', 'I like this, but I would have done a tighter crop on the right, to exclude the piece of trash on the steps. My eyes are drawn to that and it''s distracting.', '2006-01-05 21:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
