(2008502, 276399, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cool composition. Good interest factor. Seems to be a bit oversharpened or something though. And maybe a matter of taste, but I''m thinking perhaps some levels tweaking, bringing out a little more brightness may be an improvement? I do really like the solid, clean composition though :-)</td>', 'Very cool composition. Good interest factor. Seems to be a bit oversharpened or something though. And maybe a matter of taste, but I''m thinking perhaps some levels tweaking, bringing out a little more brightness may be an improvement? I do really like the solid, clean composition though :-)', '2006-01-05 21:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
