(2008517, 275939, 44743, '<td valign="top">Fantastic lighting &amp; perfect focus.  Skaters are just blurred enough to give feeling of movement.  The "floating" lights &amp; buildings make for a great background.  One of my favorites.</td>', 'Fantastic lighting & perfect focus.  Skaters are just blurred enough to give feeling of movement.  The "floating" lights & buildings make for a great background.  One of my favorites.', '2006-01-05 21:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
