(2008626, 273495, 4210, '<td valign="top">Good composition and exposure (especially on that sky, nice job!) The tower part is blurry though. I wonder if you used a tripod?</td>', 'Good composition and exposure (especially on that sky, nice job!) The tower part is blurry though. I wonder if you used a tripod?', '2006-01-05 22:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2008628, 274961, 4210, '<td valign="top">The scene is busy, but not overly distracting. I can see a series of these photos with all different types of people walking into the frame.</td>', 'The scene is busy, but not overly distracting. I can see a series of these photos with all different types of people walking into the frame.', '2006-01-05 22:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
