(2008697, 273452, 48067, '<td valign="top">Of the entries for this challenge that feature some interesting city person, I think this one is the best because of how you have more effectively placed the "Classic Man" into an urban surrounding, turning this photo into something much more intersting to look at than a mere portrait.  And besides that, this photo has me convinced that you are very skilled photographer.  Well done.</td>', 'Of the entries for this challenge that feature some interesting city person, I think this one is the best because of how you have more effectively placed the "Classic Man" into an urban surrounding, turning this photo into something much more intersting to look at than a mere portrait.  And besides that, this photo has me convinced that you are very skilled photographer.  Well done.', '2006-01-05 23:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2008704, 276290, 46045, '<td valign="top">very nice! i love all the light bursts.</td>', 'very nice! i love all the light bursts.', '2006-01-05 23:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2008774, 276058, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot. I so often see fireworks shots of just fireworks. It is so nice to see someone take a fireworks shot with some solid context like this fine example. And technically well done also. Nice job.</td>', 'Very cool shot. I so often see fireworks shots of just fireworks. It is so nice to see someone take a fireworks shot with some solid context like this fine example. And technically well done also. Nice job.', '2006-01-05 23:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2008777, 274658, 41574, '<td valign="top">Very nice, though the buildings are a bit too dark foy my taste (a slower shutter speed, though, might have over-exposed the road).</td>', 'Very nice, though the buildings are a bit too dark foy my taste (a slower shutter speed, though, might have over-exposed the road).', '2006-01-05 23:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2008782, 275972, 41574, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle, though a larger photograph might have been easier to judge.</td>', 'Interesting angle, though a larger photograph might have been easier to judge.', '2006-01-05 23:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
