(2009105, 275846, 1647, '<td valign="top">That''s a really nice interesting shot.  It shows City and it shows Life.  I live on the very outskirts of a large city (although much further from the centre than that shot).  I like the use of black+white - it simplifies the photo and let''s the viewer focus on shapes and lines and textures.</td>', 'That''s a really nice interesting shot.  It shows City and it shows Life.  I live on the very outskirts of a large city (although much further from the centre than that shot).  I like the use of black+white - it simplifies the photo and let''s the viewer focus on shapes and lines and textures.', '2006-01-06 02:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009111, 274602, 1647, '<td valign="top">Good work - it''s a good black+white shot, somewhat similar to what I originally planned to take.  The composition and angles is a little awkward but I wouldn''t say that''s a bad thing for this photo, and it definitely has the feel of a person walking by looking down.  Good work.</td>', 'Good work - it''s a good black+white shot, somewhat similar to what I originally planned to take.  The composition and angles is a little awkward but I wouldn''t say that''s a bad thing for this photo, and it definitely has the feel of a person walking by looking down.  Good work.', '2006-01-06 02:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009112, 276326, 39433, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I was going to submit a photo for this entry similar to this. Was a hectic week and wasn''t able to get the shot in, when looking at this photo city life is what comes to mine, if only you could have gottin passengers getting on and off that would have clinched it for me.</td>', 'Great shot, I was going to submit a photo for this entry similar to this. Was a hectic week and wasn''t able to get the shot in, when looking at this photo city life is what comes to mine, if only you could have gottin passengers getting on and off that would have clinched it for me.', '2006-01-06 02:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009116, 275645, 38914, '<td valign="top">try shootin your flash at the people at the end of the shot next time, awesome shot though</td>', 'try shootin your flash at the people at the end of the shot next time, awesome shot though', '2006-01-06 02:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009122, 274492, 38914, '<td valign="top">wow, but is that a fire in a city?</td>', 'wow, but is that a fire in a city?', '2006-01-06 02:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009128, 276116, 38914, '<td valign="top">best fits the contest title above all the rest, well done</td>', 'best fits the contest title above all the rest, well done', '2006-01-06 02:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
