(2009132, 276058, 38914, '<td valign="top">fantastic</td>', 'fantastic', '2006-01-06 02:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009136, 276319, 40820, '<td valign="top">great shot...a minor issue for me is the tree poking into the shot on the top left...n maybe a little at the bottom of the shot...apart from that...lovely colors and composition 8</td>', 'great shot...a minor issue for me is the tree poking into the shot on the top left...n maybe a little at the bottom of the shot...apart from that...lovely colors and composition 8', '2006-01-06 02:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009137, 275933, 38914, '<td valign="top">fancy</td>', 'fancy', '2006-01-06 02:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009139, 275236, 39433, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, love the colors, and the flow of the picture, remains me of my visits to the Phillipines. Not sure where this is taken but you captured the city life I remember from my visits to Manila, and Olungapo City.</td>', 'Nice shot, love the colors, and the flow of the picture, remains me of my visits to the Phillipines. Not sure where this is taken but you captured the city life I remember from my visits to Manila, and Olungapo City.', '2006-01-06 02:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009166, 275910, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I love the urban feel and kinetic vibe to this. The lighting and use of negative space works well..... 9</td>', 'Great shot. I love the urban feel and kinetic vibe to this. The lighting and use of negative space works well..... 9', '2006-01-06 02:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009168, 276098, 20235, '<td valign="top">Such a cool shot. Love the idea, and the execution looks great. One of my favs of this challenge..... 9</td>', 'Such a cool shot. Love the idea, and the execution looks great. One of my favs of this challenge..... 9', '2006-01-06 02:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009197, 276241, 30364, '<td valign="top">I like this.  I guess it''s the combination of the powerful vanishing point with the motion blur of the cars in the foreground.  Or maybe it''s the perspective grid formed by all those windows and mouldings on the buildings.  Either way, or even both ways, there''s something satisfying and evocative about it.  It says ''city life'' for me, even though visible people are pretty scarce.  If fact, the scarcity of people actually seems to add to the impact.  And so does the unusual point-of-view; not street level, but not rooftop level either.  And from part-way across the street, too.  Lots of interest and lots to get the viewer involved.</td>', 'I like this.  I guess it''s the combination of the powerful vanishing point with the motion blur of the cars in the foreground.  Or maybe it''s the perspective grid formed by all those windows and mouldings on the buildings.  Either way, or even both ways, there''s something satisfying and evocative about it.  It says ''city life'' for me, even though visible people are pretty scarce.  If fact, the scarcity of people actually seems to add to the impact.  And so does the unusual point-of-view; not street level, but not rooftop level either.  And from part-way across the street, too.  Lots of interest and lots to get the viewer involved.', '2006-01-06 03:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009203, 274402, 30364, '<td valign="top">That''s one dedicated street musician!  First I thought you should have cropped out the pole &amp; the trees, but then I tried it and all city context was lost.  It was no longer a photograph about the city; it became a photograph about the musician instead.  Still good, but the meaning of it changed.  Not, I feel sure, what you would have wanted.  So you made a fine choice and a fine image as a result.  Well done.</td>', 'That''s one dedicated street musician!  First I thought you should have cropped out the pole & the trees, but then I tried it and all city context was lost.  It was no longer a photograph about the city; it became a photograph about the musician instead.  Still good, but the meaning of it changed.  Not, I feel sure, what you would have wanted.  So you made a fine choice and a fine image as a result.  Well done.', '2006-01-06 03:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009209, 274862, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a sparking good street photograph!  As well as the stark composition-in-two-dimensions effect, which I like, there are several fascinating questions to engage the viewer.  First, obviously: why that hat?  Then there''s the thing in his mouth - is it a whistle?  Why?  And the walking frame - it''s in immaculate condition, and is of the type used by infirm or disabled people, yet he doesn''t look like that at first glance.  But he''s not actually walking, is he?  He seems instead to be standing still with his legs crossed, which is inexplicable.  So who, and what, is he?  He''s certainly not a homeless person (walker, watch, clothes, grooming, etc - plus he''s passing by a big bag containing valuable aluminum cans, without a glance).  There are so many ambiguous and bizarre aspects to this subject that the viewer may conclude that the photograph is a deliberately staged absurdity.  Yet I don''t think that it is!  <br/>Is it a "City Life" photograph?  Yep; it''s got to be.  Everything''s possible in the big city, even this.</td>', 'This is a sparking good street photograph!  As well as the stark composition-in-two-dimensions effect, which I like, there are several fascinating questions to engage the viewer.  First, obviously: why that hat?  Then there''s the thing in his mouth - is it a whistle?  Why?  And the walking frame - it''s in immaculate condition, and is of the type used by infirm or disabled people, yet he doesn''t look like that at first glance.  But he''s not actually walking, is he?  He seems instead to be standing still with his legs crossed, which is inexplicable.  So who, and what, is he?  He''s certainly not a homeless person (walker, watch, clothes, grooming, etc - plus he''s passing by a big bag containing valuable aluminum cans, without a glance).  There are so many ambiguous and bizarre aspects to this subject that the viewer may conclude that the photograph is a deliberately staged absurdity.  Yet I don''t think that it is!  Is it a "City Life" photograph?  Yep; it''s got to be.  Everything''s possible in the big city, even this.', '2006-01-06 04:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009212, 274756, 31443, '<td valign="top">Such a glamorous view and really nice dof but would have liked to see at least one "live" creature somewhere..</td>', 'Such a glamorous view and really nice dof but would have liked to see at least one "live" creature somewhere..', '2006-01-06 04:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009216, 274763, 31443, '<td valign="top">A really busy image but I liked the concentration of the people in the middle separating them from the lights, nice to look at..</td>', 'A really busy image but I liked the concentration of the people in the middle separating them from the lights, nice to look at..', '2006-01-06 04:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009217, 275306, 30364, '<td valign="top">The addition of the bicycle transforms this into a delightful whimsy.  A simple idea, or inspiration, well executed.  And it''s a legitimate and witty "City Life" parody as well.  All in all, pretty clever and very entertaining.  Well done.</td>', 'The addition of the bicycle transforms this into a delightful whimsy.  A simple idea, or inspiration, well executed.  And it''s a legitimate and witty "City Life" parody as well.  All in all, pretty clever and very entertaining.  Well done.', '2006-01-06 04:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009221, 276466, 31443, '<td valign="top">A political statement doesn''t go down well with most people, you took a big risk..I''m really looking forward to checking this image at the end of the challenge, the grid will be really interesting to look at. Apart from all that, nicely shot!</td>', 'A political statement doesn''t go down well with most people, you took a big risk..I''m really looking forward to checking this image at the end of the challenge, the grid will be really interesting to look at. Apart from all that, nicely shot!', '2006-01-06 04:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009226, 276045, 31443, '<td valign="top">Now, this is the ideal city life, wonder if b/w was the right choice since this is really happy colorful times..?</td>', 'Now, this is the ideal city life, wonder if b/w was the right choice since this is really happy colorful times..?', '2006-01-06 04:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009227, 276360, 30364, '<td valign="top">A clever idea, to see and depict the building as the city reciprocal of the Christmas tree.  There aren''t a lot of truly thoughtful and meaningful images in this challenge, but this is certainly one of them.</td>', 'A clever idea, to see and depict the building as the city reciprocal of the Christmas tree.  There aren''t a lot of truly thoughtful and meaningful images in this challenge, but this is certainly one of them.', '2006-01-06 04:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009229, 275933, 31443, '<td valign="top">Thoughtful message...sadly it''s so often true, a person can be alone and isolated among the millions. Nice composition although the building on the top left is distracting..</td>', 'Thoughtful message...sadly it''s so often true, a person can be alone and isolated among the millions. Nice composition although the building on the top left is distracting..', '2006-01-06 04:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009231, 273797, 31443, '<td valign="top">Nice moment, too bad the cyclist''s face is covered..</td>', 'Nice moment, too bad the cyclist''s face is covered..', '2006-01-06 04:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009236, 275638, 30364, '<td valign="top">Yes - it is contradictions such as this that often define life in the city.  Parking and access are subjects more important, in a very practical sense, than seasonal goodwill to fellow man.  And there''s really nothing insincere or hypocritical about that; it''s just a fact of life in the city.  Well done - it''s a fine and thoughtful take on the challenge.</td>', 'Yes - it is contradictions such as this that often define life in the city.  Parking and access are subjects more important, in a very practical sense, than seasonal goodwill to fellow man.  And there''s really nothing insincere or hypocritical about that; it''s just a fact of life in the city.  Well done - it''s a fine and thoughtful take on the challenge.', '2006-01-06 04:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009241, 276094, 29658, '<td valign="top">I''d have composed focusing on less point of interest, letting the viewer understand what is the message you want to pass. Putting too many points of interest is confusing. Nice environment.</td>', 'I''d have composed focusing on less point of interest, letting the viewer understand what is the message you want to pass. Putting too many points of interest is confusing. Nice environment.', '2006-01-06 04:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009243, 275645, 18080, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.<br/>My pick for a top 10<br/>Good Luck<br/>Kev</td>', 'Beautiful.My pick for a top 10Good LuckKev', '2006-01-06 04:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009244, 275910, 18080, '<td valign="top">Really like this shot. Shows the rush of city life.<br/>9<br/>good luck</td>', 'Really like this shot. Shows the rush of city life.9good luck', '2006-01-06 04:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009246, 275242, 18080, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Giving it a 9. Not sure how well it says city life. I think it does but not sure about my fellow DPCers.<br/>Good Luck<br/> <br/>Kev</td>', 'Nice image. Giving it a 9. Not sure how well it says city life. I think it does but not sure about my fellow DPCers.Good Luck Kev', '2006-01-06 04:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009249, 275638, 47956, '<td valign="top">Love the irony 8</td>', 'Love the irony 8', '2006-01-06 04:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009250, 275933, 47956, '<td valign="top">7</td>', '7', '2006-01-06 04:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009252, 276267, 30364, '<td valign="top">The visual interest here is the stacked layers of transportation, but it has worthy allegorical implications as well, in terms of the challenge topic.  In so many aspects of city life, creative solutions to problems of space, time and motion must be found.  They''re often solutions that appear absurd to a country boy like me, yet to the city dweller they don''t even rate a second glance or thought.   Congratulations on finding an opportunity to portray city life both literally and figuratively.</td>', 'The visual interest here is the stacked layers of transportation, but it has worthy allegorical implications as well, in terms of the challenge topic.  In so many aspects of city life, creative solutions to problems of space, time and motion must be found.  They''re often solutions that appear absurd to a country boy like me, yet to the city dweller they don''t even rate a second glance or thought.   Congratulations on finding an opportunity to portray city life both literally and figuratively.', '2006-01-06 04:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009253, 276116, 2022, '<td valign="top">Great photo, one of my favourites (9)</td>', 'Great photo, one of my favourites (9)', '2006-01-06 04:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009254, 276215, 49511, '<td valign="top">wow, a floating policecar!</td>', 'wow, a floating policecar!', '2006-01-06 04:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009256, 275834, 2022, '<td valign="top">Looks like Eaton''s center in Toronto, but I could be wrong. Great shot (7)</td>', 'Looks like Eaton''s center in Toronto, but I could be wrong. Great shot (7)', '2006-01-06 04:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009257, 275242, 47956, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, the lone figure adds the "life" in this. Colour might have been nice too. 9</td>', 'Nice composition, the lone figure adds the "life" in this. Colour might have been nice too. 9', '2006-01-06 04:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
