(2009265, 274083, 2022, '<td valign="top">Well, the only link to the challenge here seems to be in the title...otherwise I would not have any idea that the picture is supposed to depict city life...I never like it, the link to the challenge should be obvious from the picture even if there is no title...sorry (4)</td>', 'Well, the only link to the challenge here seems to be in the title...otherwise I would not have any idea that the picture is supposed to depict city life...I never like it, the link to the challenge should be obvious from the picture even if there is no title...sorry (4)', '2006-01-06 04:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009266, 275538, 47956, '<td valign="top">Cripes! You''re a braver man/woman than I. More of a rural town nature but an awesome image nontheless. I might have gone for a slighty faster shutter speed, but I guess that would be less dynamic. 9</td>', 'Cripes! You''re a braver man/woman than I. More of a rural town nature but an awesome image nontheless. I might have gone for a slighty faster shutter speed, but I guess that would be less dynamic. 9', '2006-01-06 04:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
