(2009296, 275356, 47956, '<td valign="top">Great shot, would be good for a drink-drive ad campaign, but it may be a little too much PS. 5</td>', 'Great shot, would be good for a drink-drive ad campaign, but it may be a little too much PS. 5', '2006-01-06 05:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009297, 276479, 30364, '<td valign="top">I like the dramatic juxtaposition here.  The transition from city to mountains and sky is so stark and spectacular as to appear unrealistic.  And yet it is real.  I''ll guess somewhere in Colorado, USA?  <br/>It''s probably not really about city life in the sense that some of the more visceral images in the challenge are, but it is at least a photograph of a town that might be a city, and its quality of visual surprise makes it a worthy and legitimate entry.</td>', 'I like the dramatic juxtaposition here.  The transition from city to mountains and sky is so stark and spectacular as to appear unrealistic.  And yet it is real.  I''ll guess somewhere in Colorado, USA?  It''s probably not really about city life in the sense that some of the more visceral images in the challenge are, but it is at least a photograph of a town that might be a city, and its quality of visual surprise makes it a worthy and legitimate entry.', '2006-01-06 05:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009298, 276267, 47956, '<td valign="top">Three tiers of transport..brilliant. You missed the air transport. Should take a point off for that but I won''t. 10</td>', 'Three tiers of transport..brilliant. You missed the air transport. Should take a point off for that but I won''t. 10', '2006-01-06 05:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009303, 276467, 47956, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image but..gee..can''t see City Life" in this one. Would rate 10 in another challenge but sadly will have to drop to 5.</td>', 'Beautiful image but..gee..can''t see City Life" in this one. Would rate 10 in another challenge but sadly will have to drop to 5.', '2006-01-06 05:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
