(2009384, 275950, 35602, '<td valign="top">Really digitized.  The pixels seem to be too large for this image.  Maybe when you were saving it, you put the resolution to low.  Try a resolution of atleast display value, which is 96.  Might make the detail come closer together.</td>', 'Really digitized.  The pixels seem to be too large for this image.  Maybe when you were saving it, you put the resolution to low.  Try a resolution of atleast display value, which is 96.  Might make the detail come closer together.', '2006-01-06 07:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
