(2009386, 273452, 47956, '<td valign="top">If a picture can say a thousand words, this image speaks volume to me. I''ve looked at this one 1/2 dozen times and can see different things in it each time. The "Classic Man" seems to be dressed for a special occasion. A business meeting? Perhaps going to court? Could be going to the local racetrack,maybe coming back from the racetrack.<br/>Then there''s the bloke in the VeeDub. He''s ogling the senorita on the footpath. <br/>And everyone intent on their own business and personal thoughts. A powerful image in my view and I hope to see it get blue. 10.</td>', 'If a picture can say a thousand words, this image speaks volume to me. I''ve looked at this one 1/2 dozen times and can see different things in it each time. The "Classic Man" seems to be dressed for a special occasion. A business meeting? Perhaps going to court? Could be going to the local racetrack,maybe coming back from the racetrack.Then there''s the bloke in the VeeDub. He''s ogling the senorita on the footpath. And everyone intent on their own business and personal thoughts. A powerful image in my view and I hope to see it get blue. 10.', '2006-01-06 07:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
