(2009402, 274853, 18219, '<td valign="top">I''m not too keen on the purple tint/cast that you have going on.<br/>i think a simple  black and white would have been better.</td>', 'I''m not too keen on the purple tint/cast that you have going on.i think a simple  black and white would have been better.', '2006-01-06 07:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2009403, 276076, 35602, '<td valign="top">Great contrast on this one.  The most clear part is the building door in the background, but I think the subject fails me.  Because of the out of focus people, which is where my eye naturally goes first, the composition seems reversed.  Perhaps a better way to do it would have been to pan on one particular person, blurring everything around him?  Don''t know, but I did an experiment where I panned my hand with the camera to blur out the background, and it really came out good.  Try it yourself.  You''ld be surprised how detailed you can get when moving your camera at the same rate of speed as the subject.</td>', 'Great contrast on this one.  The most clear part is the building door in the background, but I think the subject fails me.  Because of the out of focus people, which is where my eye naturally goes first, the composition seems reversed.  Perhaps a better way to do it would have been to pan on one particular person, blurring everything around him?  Don''t know, but I did an experiment where I panned my hand with the camera to blur out the background, and it really came out good.  Try it yourself.  You''ld be surprised how detailed you can get when moving your camera at the same rate of speed as the subject.', '2006-01-06 07:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
