(2010402, 275645, 50641, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  If it were mine I might play with cropping out the blurry stuff in the foreground, possibly some to the right as well(?) - and possibly up the contrast to accentuate that guy sitting on the bridge. Just a thought. Might be easier to do outside of basic editing tho.  My eye loves those split domes (amphitheater?) in the background.  Thanks for this.</td>', 'Cool shot.  If it were mine I might play with cropping out the blurry stuff in the foreground, possibly some to the right as well(?) - and possibly up the contrast to accentuate that guy sitting on the bridge. Just a thought. Might be easier to do outside of basic editing tho.  My eye loves those split domes (amphitheater?) in the background.  Thanks for this.', '2006-01-06 15:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2010417, 276362, 50641, '<td valign="top">or maybe "City Death".  Nice creative interpretation of the challenge.  Crisply crowded yet very thematically focussed.  I love the pink tombstone.</td>', 'or maybe "City Death".  Nice creative interpretation of the challenge.  Crisply crowded yet very thematically focussed.  I love the pink tombstone.', '2006-01-06 15:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
