(2010421, 274081, 50641, '<td valign="top">The placement of the streetlamps makes this remind me of Van Gogh''s Starry Night over the Rhone.  Wonder if it''s just a touch bottom-heavy?  Pretty shot.<br/> <br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.bellatrixobservatory.org/cvaaI/33/nssrsmall.jpg'', strrpos(''//www.bellatrixobservatory.org/cvaaI/33/nssrsmall.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.bellatrixobservatory.org/cvaaI/33/nssrsmall.jpg"/> <br/> <br/> <br/>(my previous comment somehow disappeared, sorry if duplicate)</td>', 'The placement of the streetlamps makes this remind me of Van Gogh''s Starry Night over the Rhone.  Wonder if it''s just a touch bottom-heavy?  Pretty shot.     (my previous comment somehow disappeared, sorry if duplicate)', '2006-01-06 15:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
