(2010544, 276065, 50502, '<td valign="top">Really like the portrait of the rickshaw drive, wish it weren''t so dark though and that there was mor perspective extending back and to the right</td>', 'Really like the portrait of the rickshaw drive, wish it weren''t so dark though and that there was mor perspective extending back and to the right', '2006-01-06 16:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2010545, 275297, 50502, '<td valign="top">I guess you can kind of see the reflection of ''the city'' in the iris here, but you''ve got to look pretty hard</td>', 'I guess you can kind of see the reflection of ''the city'' in the iris here, but you''ve got to look pretty hard', '2006-01-06 16:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2010547, 274763, 50502, '<td valign="top">Like the sense of vibrancy but a little cluttered for my taste and blurry in the foreground</td>', 'Like the sense of vibrancy but a little cluttered for my taste and blurry in the foreground', '2006-01-06 16:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2010550, 276094, 50502, '<td valign="top">Don''t find this perspective very interesting</td>', 'Don''t find this perspective very interesting', '2006-01-06 16:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2010553, 273495, 50502, '<td valign="top">Would like to see more motion blur here; don''t especially like the perspective; but still a nice shot</td>', 'Would like to see more motion blur here; don''t especially like the perspective; but still a nice shot', '2006-01-06 16:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2010555, 275261, 50502, '<td valign="top">Like the colors but seems that the intent was to capture some of the reflection in the window glass and didn''t get enough of it</td>', 'Like the colors but seems that the intent was to capture some of the reflection in the window glass and didn''t get enough of it', '2006-01-06 16:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2010557, 275260, 50502, '<td valign="top">Nice scene but seems a bit unfocused and too straight-on in perspective</td>', 'Nice scene but seems a bit unfocused and too straight-on in perspective', '2006-01-06 16:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2010562, 276446, 50502, '<td valign="top">Love those vegas lights but don''t find the perspective very interesting--not very clearly defined as the gaze moves from front to back, too straight-on</td>', 'Love those vegas lights but don''t find the perspective very interesting--not very clearly defined as the gaze moves from front to back, too straight-on', '2006-01-06 16:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2010564, 275645, 50502, '<td valign="top">Rally interesting--lights, fireworks and the perspective; would like to see more definition in the foreground and figures</td>', 'Rally interesting--lights, fireworks and the perspective; would like to see more definition in the foreground and figures', '2006-01-06 16:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2010566, 275972, 50502, '<td valign="top">Good idea in capturing the geometry of the parked cars, sort of a tilted, odd perspective though</td>', 'Good idea in capturing the geometry of the parked cars, sort of a tilted, odd perspective though', '2006-01-06 16:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2010567, 276399, 30364, '<td valign="top">This has great potential.  He''s a terrific subject, well framed between the taxi and the road markings.  The composition is nicely sympathetic to the point implicit in the guy''s body language (and explicit in your title).  And of course, it meets the challenge topic well.  The processing, however, is perhaps not chosen to get maximum effect out of the image.  It seems grainy, flat and muddy for no apparent good reason.  The potential drama of the scene is thus diminished.  Something sharp and stark, but with a rich tonal range, would have been more suitable, I think.   But even so, the several positives do outweigh that one negative.<br/>Just dropped back in (sorry!) to add a further comment:  The use of negative space here is very instructive.  The big blank area of road behind the man is an essential part of the meaning of this image.  He''s dropping out because he has no reason to not do so.</td>', 'This has great potential.  He''s a terrific subject, well framed between the taxi and the road markings.  The composition is nicely sympathetic to the point implicit in the guy''s body language (and explicit in your title).  And of course, it meets the challenge topic well.  The processing, however, is perhaps not chosen to get maximum effect out of the image.  It seems grainy, flat and muddy for no apparent good reason.  The potential drama of the scene is thus diminished.  Something sharp and stark, but with a rich tonal range, would have been more suitable, I think.   But even so, the several positives do outweigh that one negative.Just dropped back in (sorry!) to add a further comment:  The use of negative space here is very instructive.  The big blank area of road behind the man is an essential part of the meaning of this image.  He''s dropping out because he has no reason to not do so.', '2006-01-06 16:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2010630, 276268, 41554, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.</td>', 'Gorgeous.', '2006-01-06 17:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2010646, 275742, 48467, '<td valign="top">crop so the pole is the right border</td>', 'crop so the pole is the right border', '2006-01-06 17:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
