(2010671, 275334, 48467, '<td valign="top">this isnt very interesting. the blinding white cloud of doom coming in from the upper right is alarming and distracting; i hope you survived it.</td>', 'this isnt very interesting. the blinding white cloud of doom coming in from the upper right is alarming and distracting; i hope you survived it.', '2006-01-06 17:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
