(2010753, 276466, 44490, '<td valign="top">Interesting commentary.  Thought about rotate, but it probably works in both orientations, and the clutter has meaning even if it isn''t beautiful.  Like it.</td>', 'Interesting commentary.  Thought about rotate, but it probably works in both orientations, and the clutter has meaning even if it isn''t beautiful.  Like it.', '2006-01-06 18:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
