(2010758, 276319, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice lights and color.  The blue is overdone, but I still like it a lot.</td>', 'Nice lights and color.  The blue is overdone, but I still like it a lot.', '2006-01-06 18:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
