(2010779, 274980, 44490, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, love the combination of bridge, skyline, and head/tail-lights.  I wonder if you could have moved forward to get the cross-beam lower or out of the frame.  Nice.</td>', 'Interesting composition, love the combination of bridge, skyline, and head/tail-lights.  I wonder if you could have moved forward to get the cross-beam lower or out of the frame.  Nice.', '2006-01-06 18:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2010796, 276466, 44776, '<td valign="top">Great capture and idea!</td>', 'Great capture and idea!', '2006-01-06 18:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2010799, 276303, 44776, '<td valign="top">Brilliant colors and interesting shapes.  I even like the tilted back look.</td>', 'Brilliant colors and interesting shapes.  I even like the tilted back look.', '2006-01-06 18:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2010803, 274160, 50641, '<td valign="top">Worthwhile twist.</td>', 'Worthwhile twist.', '2006-01-06 18:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2010805, 274639, 50641, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scrolls and scritchy things everywhere.  I love the textures and the warmth.  Fantastical scene.  Nice of them to grow pretty  vines over the ugly coffee &amp; tea signs, haha.  Is it really within a city?  Maybe might have mentioned which one in the title  - or somehow insinuated that this is indeed a city scene within the photo (maybe tough to do).  Overall, enchanting.</td>', 'Beautiful scrolls and scritchy things everywhere.  I love the textures and the warmth.  Fantastical scene.  Nice of them to grow pretty  vines over the ugly coffee & tea signs, haha.  Is it really within a city?  Maybe might have mentioned which one in the title  - or somehow insinuated that this is indeed a city scene within the photo (maybe tough to do).  Overall, enchanting.', '2006-01-06 18:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2010852, 274492, 38234, '<td valign="top">to me this does not depict city life as a fireman could be anywhere as they are not only in the city - I do like the over the shoulder perspective though</td>', 'to me this does not depict city life as a fireman could be anywhere as they are not only in the city - I do like the over the shoulder perspective though', '2006-01-06 18:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
