(2011024, 274606, 45776, '<td valign="top">Great shot! I really like the color slide film feel of this, you need to teach me how to do this.<br/> <br/>The more I look at this one, the more I like it. I''m bumping it up to a 10. The compisition is great, and this shot, moreso than any other in the challenge, captures the ''feel'' of a city. I''m not sure how this is going to be recieved by the community, but in my book it is amazing.</td>', 'Great shot! I really like the color slide film feel of this, you need to teach me how to do this. The more I look at this one, the more I like it. I''m bumping it up to a 10. The compisition is great, and this shot, moreso than any other in the challenge, captures the ''feel'' of a city. I''m not sure how this is going to be recieved by the community, but in my book it is amazing.', '2006-01-06 19:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
