(2011894, 276027, 1647, '<td valign="top">I like the framing and the star effect on the light sources works well for this shot.  Without the title it''s a little confusing whether the ride or bus of the centre of interest (or maybe even the green traffic light), but it''s quite a good shot.</td>', 'I like the framing and the star effect on the light sources works well for this shot.  Without the title it''s a little confusing whether the ride or bus of the centre of interest (or maybe even the green traffic light), but it''s quite a good shot.', '2006-01-07 01:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
