(2013133, 274083, 41574, '<td valign="top">A phenomenal photograph, but it doesn''t really represent "city life" (I''m sure that both firefighters and fires exist the all over rural towns). That said, the fact that it''s a delivery truck that''s on fire, does help. Photograph, per se: "10"; fitting the challenge: "5"; TOTAL: "7."</td>', 'A phenomenal photograph, but it doesn''t really represent "city life" (I''m sure that both firefighters and fires exist the all over rural towns). That said, the fact that it''s a delivery truck that''s on fire, does help. Photograph, per se: "10"; fitting the challenge: "5"; TOTAL: "7."', '2006-01-07 16:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
