(2014080, 276404, 42638, '<td valign="top">I really like the use of sepia and grain in this picture with the context and title. Very nice antique feel.</td>', 'I really like the use of sepia and grain in this picture with the context and title. Very nice antique feel.', '2006-01-08 00:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014126, 275316, 1647, '<td valign="top">Such a common view in cities like New York.  The image doesn''t make a particular statement about the traffic though.  What were you hoping the image would express?</td>', 'Such a common view in cities like New York.  The image doesn''t make a particular statement about the traffic though.  What were you hoping the image would express?', '2006-01-08 00:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014128, 276290, 1647, '<td valign="top">Probably the nicest long-exposure in the challenge.  Lovely rich colours, nice flowing lines that all converge together and the star effect on the streetlights really adds a nice sparkle to the shot.  Great work!</td>', 'Probably the nicest long-exposure in the challenge.  Lovely rich colours, nice flowing lines that all converge together and the star effect on the streetlights really adds a nice sparkle to the shot.  Great work!', '2006-01-08 00:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014135, 275972, 1647, '<td valign="top">That''s an awkward angle you chose for the shot - kind of implies you don''t particularly like city life.  If that was your intention then well done.  There isn''t a particular focal point though, so it doesn''t hold your attention for long.</td>', 'That''s an awkward angle you chose for the shot - kind of implies you don''t particularly like city life.  If that was your intention then well done.  There isn''t a particular focal point though, so it doesn''t hold your attention for long.', '2006-01-08 00:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014142, 276105, 1647, '<td valign="top">The contrast of the bright nearby buildings to the darkened city in the background is well done.  I am guessing this is what you mean by "Oasis" - an oasis in the night.</td>', 'The contrast of the bright nearby buildings to the darkened city in the background is well done.  I am guessing this is what you mean by "Oasis" - an oasis in the night.', '2006-01-08 00:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014148, 274374, 1647, '<td valign="top">Something tells me that your "City" is a little bit "Country" - but, hey, that''s cool.  The image looks a bit blotchy and the colour is a little off - perhaps if you could have taken the shot when the sun was behind the camera, rather than behind the sign.  I love the inclusion of a person (perhaps yourself even) in the shot!</td>', 'Something tells me that your "City" is a little bit "Country" - but, hey, that''s cool.  The image looks a bit blotchy and the colour is a little off - perhaps if you could have taken the shot when the sun was behind the camera, rather than behind the sign.  I love the inclusion of a person (perhaps yourself even) in the shot!', '2006-01-08 00:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014153, 276215, 1647, '<td valign="top">It took me a minute to get the title - instinct made me look for a bobby somewhere in the shot.  Having the car blurred is fine, but it would have been nice if the buildings were sharp.  Try a tripod, or at least sit the camera on or against something solid to help you out maybe.</td>', 'It took me a minute to get the title - instinct made me look for a bobby somewhere in the shot.  Having the car blurred is fine, but it would have been nice if the buildings were sharp.  Try a tripod, or at least sit the camera on or against something solid to help you out maybe.', '2006-01-08 00:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014159, 274721, 1647, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot - quite dark and gloomy, but that''s kind of appropriate.</td>', 'Not a bad shot - quite dark and gloomy, but that''s kind of appropriate.', '2006-01-08 00:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014165, 276098, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great work - the colour is great, the expression is good and the composition/framing is very well done.  The sharpening is taken too it''s limit but I wouldn''t say it''s oversharpened.  Having the person generally lighter than the background works extremely well - but something tells me you know enough about photography to realise that yourself.  Great work - at the top end of the results for me.</td>', 'Great work - the colour is great, the expression is good and the composition/framing is very well done.  The sharpening is taken too it''s limit but I wouldn''t say it''s oversharpened.  Having the person generally lighter than the background works extremely well - but something tells me you know enough about photography to realise that yourself.  Great work - at the top end of the results for me.', '2006-01-08 00:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014170, 275437, 1647, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised there isn''t more New Years shots in this challenge.  This looks suspiciously like the back of the Sydney Harbour Bridge.  I think you could have cropped the bottom edge a bit more to remove the greenish mass in the centre of the frame.</td>', 'I''m surprised there isn''t more New Years shots in this challenge.  This looks suspiciously like the back of the Sydney Harbour Bridge.  I think you could have cropped the bottom edge a bit more to remove the greenish mass in the centre of the frame.', '2006-01-08 00:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014173, 274755, 1647, '<td valign="top">That looks like an interesting cloud formation.  I''m guessing your title implies that you were surprised other people weren''t interested in it.  The clouds are a little overexposed though and the people are a bit dark so I''m not sure what you wanted the focal point to be.  If it was the cloud I would have exposed less to keep more detail in them.</td>', 'That looks like an interesting cloud formation.  I''m guessing your title implies that you were surprised other people weren''t interested in it.  The clouds are a little overexposed though and the people are a bit dark so I''m not sure what you wanted the focal point to be.  If it was the cloud I would have exposed less to keep more detail in them.', '2006-01-08 00:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014177, 276376, 1647, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of the old church against the modern sky-scrapers.  The shot looks a little soft - perhaps a bit of shake with the long exposure?</td>', 'I like the contrast of the old church against the modern sky-scrapers.  The shot looks a little soft - perhaps a bit of shake with the long exposure?', '2006-01-08 00:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014181, 276121, 1647, '<td valign="top">I love the transition from dark to light.  I''m also a sucker for architecture and symmetry, so I think this shot is wonderful.  The way it disappears into the cloud is great.  Finally, your choice of black+white is brilliant - it really simplifies the shot and let''s the viewer focus on the building and it''s patterns.  Great work!  PS: Composition is also particularly good.</td>', 'I love the transition from dark to light.  I''m also a sucker for architecture and symmetry, so I think this shot is wonderful.  The way it disappears into the cloud is great.  Finally, your choice of black+white is brilliant - it really simplifies the shot and let''s the viewer focus on the building and it''s patterns.  Great work!  PS: Composition is also particularly good.', '2006-01-08 00:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014183, 276431, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great colours, nice symmetry and the people form a strong focal point by being silohuetted.  Good work - it makes me want to know more about where they are and what they are waiting for.</td>', 'Great colours, nice symmetry and the people form a strong focal point by being silohuetted.  Good work - it makes me want to know more about where they are and what they are waiting for.', '2006-01-08 00:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014195, 274083, 1647, '<td valign="top">Good work, capturing some real life action - maybe could have provided the shot  to a newspaper or something.  Composition is good and the smoke makes a great interesting background.  A more witty title might have worked - the truck looks like it belongs to a cooking company, based on the chef''s hat.  Maybe something like "Bertrands new flame-grilled range of foods" or "Bertrands cancels ''Cook-while-delivering'' strategy"?</td>', 'Good work, capturing some real life action - maybe could have provided the shot  to a newspaper or something.  Composition is good and the smoke makes a great interesting background.  A more witty title might have worked - the truck looks like it belongs to a cooking company, based on the chef''s hat.  Maybe something like "Bertrands new flame-grilled range of foods" or "Bertrands cancels ''Cook-while-delivering'' strategy"?', '2006-01-08 00:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014199, 276277, 1647, '<td valign="top">There doesn''t seem to be a tree growing there yet.  I''m assuming that your statement is that there is a lack of natural plant life in the city.</td>', 'There doesn''t seem to be a tree growing there yet.  I''m assuming that your statement is that there is a lack of natural plant life in the city.', '2006-01-08 00:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014204, 276326, 1647, '<td valign="top">That''s a very good shot of the tram - in action in a fairly attractive surrounging.  Maybe a polarising filter would have reduced the glare/reflection  on the drivers cabin.  Composition / framing is quite good</td>', 'That''s a very good shot of the tram - in action in a fairly attractive surrounging.  Maybe a polarising filter would have reduced the glare/reflection  on the drivers cabin.  Composition / framing is quite good', '2006-01-08 00:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014212, 275328, 1647, '<td valign="top">I like the colour, although the slight rotation in the image was immediately distracting.  Unfortunately, simple things like this can really distract viewers so always watch out for them - a quick rotation in any image software would have corrected this.</td>', 'I like the colour, although the slight rotation in the image was immediately distracting.  Unfortunately, simple things like this can really distract viewers so always watch out for them - a quick rotation in any image software would have corrected this.', '2006-01-08 00:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014216, 276472, 1647, '<td valign="top">It looks like a pretty good photo - a nice strong leading line.  Why make it so small though?  DPChallenge allows anything up to 640x640 so always try to have either hieght or width (or both) around that limit.  It''s normally better to reduce the JPEG quality if you need to get back under 150KB.</td>', 'It looks like a pretty good photo - a nice strong leading line.  Why make it so small though?  DPChallenge allows anything up to 640x640 so always try to have either hieght or width (or both) around that limit.  It''s normally better to reduce the JPEG quality if you need to get back under 150KB.', '2006-01-08 00:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014221, 275998, 1647, '<td valign="top">I like the psuedo double-exposure created by the reflection in the window, however the people are too bright compared to the city lights.  I can imagine you had little/no control over that fact though.  Perhaps a more interesting (less factual) title could have been chosen - something about keeping watch over the city, or chatting the night away - especially since the challenge is about "Life" so the people are in many ways the focal point.</td>', 'I like the psuedo double-exposure created by the reflection in the window, however the people are too bright compared to the city lights.  I can imagine you had little/no control over that fact though.  Perhaps a more interesting (less factual) title could have been chosen - something about keeping watch over the city, or chatting the night away - especially since the challenge is about "Life" so the people are in many ways the focal point.', '2006-01-08 00:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014223, 274055, 1647, '<td valign="top">Stunning portrait! Need I say any more?  Colour is brilliant, composition is great.  Bordering on being over-sharpened, but not quite (for this size at least).  Perhaps for this challenge placing him in the city (via the background) would have been effective, but it''s still a great shot.</td>', 'Stunning portrait! Need I say any more?  Colour is brilliant, composition is great.  Bordering on being over-sharpened, but not quite (for this size at least).  Perhaps for this challenge placing him in the city (via the background) would have been effective, but it''s still a great shot.', '2006-01-08 00:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014226, 274989, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice artistic interpretation of this shot.  I like the rich blue and red/brown in the shot.  Well done.  There appears to be a spot in the top-left corner of the sky (about 20-50 pixels in) - perhaps dust on your lens / sensor?</td>', 'Nice artistic interpretation of this shot.  I like the rich blue and red/brown in the shot.  Well done.  There appears to be a spot in the top-left corner of the sky (about 20-50 pixels in) - perhaps dust on your lens / sensor?', '2006-01-08 01:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014231, 275910, 1647, '<td valign="top">Good work - the blurring of the train is done beautifully, just enough to show motion but not overdone.  The almost-silohuetted people also works really good.   Their faces really stand out compared to the darkened clothing.  Great job!</td>', 'Good work - the blurring of the train is done beautifully, just enough to show motion but not overdone.  The almost-silohuetted people also works really good.   Their faces really stand out compared to the darkened clothing.  Great job!', '2006-01-08 01:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014238, 273604, 1647, '<td valign="top">Awesome - I love historic items like this.  They always seem to present photographic opportunities.  My only criticism would be the harshly lit spot at the top of the box - probably from the sun.  You probably had few options to avoid this but ideally a diffusion panel would have softened the lighting (including the shadow from the handle).  I love the colour - glad you chose that over black+white.</td>', 'Awesome - I love historic items like this.  They always seem to present photographic opportunities.  My only criticism would be the harshly lit spot at the top of the box - probably from the sun.  You probably had few options to avoid this but ideally a diffusion panel would have softened the lighting (including the shadow from the handle).  I love the colour - glad you chose that over black+white.', '2006-01-08 01:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014246, 274160, 1647, '<td valign="top">I''m going to assume you used selective colour replacement - hence the reason for an orange car and two red cars still.  I love the result.  If you were printing this I''d be tempted to leave them coloured as they currently are.  Great work - I''m really impressed by this shot.</td>', 'I''m going to assume you used selective colour replacement - hence the reason for an orange car and two red cars still.  I love the result.  If you were printing this I''d be tempted to leave them coloured as they currently are.  Great work - I''m really impressed by this shot.', '2006-01-08 01:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014254, 273652, 1647, '<td valign="top">The deep blue sky works wonderfully - this shot has great colour from the red/orange road to the yellow (attention grabbing) building to the blue sky.  It''s a shame about the traffic lights and poles though - they kind of cut right through the building.  I wonder if you could have recomposed slightly to fix this - maybe not though.</td>', 'The deep blue sky works wonderfully - this shot has great colour from the red/orange road to the yellow (attention grabbing) building to the blue sky.  It''s a shame about the traffic lights and poles though - they kind of cut right through the building.  I wonder if you could have recomposed slightly to fix this - maybe not though.', '2006-01-08 01:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014264, 276267, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice work - so many different elements combined into the one shot.  Crossings is a good title.  Black+white was probably a very wise decision, otherwise there would have been too much going on in the shot - it''s already very busy without colour.  The slightly soft contrast (rather than vivid black and white extremes) also works well for me, makign the shot less aggressive.</td>', 'Nice work - so many different elements combined into the one shot.  Crossings is a good title.  Black+white was probably a very wise decision, otherwise there would have been too much going on in the shot - it''s already very busy without colour.  The slightly soft contrast (rather than vivid black and white extremes) also works well for me, makign the shot less aggressive.', '2006-01-08 01:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014333, 275242, 25397, '<td valign="top">Hmmm I wonder where the man came from. :-D<br/> <br/>It''s the thought that counts</td>', 'Hmmm I wonder where the man came from. :-D It''s the thought that counts', '2006-01-08 01:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014423, 274160, 8860, '<td valign="top">nice idea and good viewpoint.</td>', 'nice idea and good viewpoint.', '2006-01-08 04:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014431, 275242, 8860, '<td valign="top">Oversmoothed, this shot has lost some of its impact through an obsession with the processing. It looks like everything is in place though; poignancy, scale, context, composition, but my eyes crave the missing texture.<br/> <br/>A empathise totally with the point you make here, so top marks for the social comment.</td>', 'Oversmoothed, this shot has lost some of its impact through an obsession with the processing. It looks like everything is in place though; poignancy, scale, context, composition, but my eyes crave the missing texture. A empathise totally with the point you make here, so top marks for the social comment.', '2006-01-08 04:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014432, 276427, 8860, '<td valign="top">Technically imperfect, but I''d rather look at this shot than 99% of the other standard views. This says so much. And is that a satellite TV dish in the middle of ths shot? What a crazy world.</td>', 'Technically imperfect, but I''d rather look at this shot than 99% of the other standard views. This says so much. And is that a satellite TV dish in the middle of ths shot? What a crazy world.', '2006-01-08 04:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014434, 276058, 8860, '<td valign="top">Well chosen view of this frequently shot Icelandic masterpiece. The rear firework makes the shot and you''ve got some nice context. Some nice drama and possibly a ribbon I expect due to the eye candy on show.</td>', 'Well chosen view of this frequently shot Icelandic masterpiece. The rear firework makes the shot and you''ve got some nice context. Some nice drama and possibly a ribbon I expect due to the eye candy on show.', '2006-01-08 04:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2014435, 276211, 8860, '<td valign="top">Technically imperfect, but I''d rather look at this shot than 99% of the other standard views. This says so much. And is that a satellite TV dish in the middle of ths shot? What a crazy world.</td>', 'Technically imperfect, but I''d rather look at this shot than 99% of the other standard views. This says so much. And is that a satellite TV dish in the middle of ths shot? What a crazy world.', '2006-01-08 04:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
