(2015482, 276157, 47852, '<td valign="top">A bit busy in the front with all of the lines, but the repetition of the windows in the background makes it ok.  The colors are wonderful, and in perfect thirds.  One of my favorite shots from this challenge... well done!</td>', 'A bit busy in the front with all of the lines, but the repetition of the windows in the background makes it ok.  The colors are wonderful, and in perfect thirds.  One of my favorite shots from this challenge... well done!', '2006-01-08 17:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
