(2016305, 276098, 15575, '<td valign="top">I think that an extra stop of DOF would be helpful to keep the chin sharp but continue to have the nice OOF lights in the background.  A tad noicy, but nothing to significant to detract from the quality of the image that much.  Overall 8</td>', 'I think that an extra stop of DOF would be helpful to keep the chin sharp but continue to have the nice OOF lights in the background.  A tad noicy, but nothing to significant to detract from the quality of the image that much.  Overall 8', '2006-01-08 22:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
