(2018749, 274160, 35804, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love the selective Desat. used in this image. The tones in general a so nice...very nice.</td>', 'I absolutely love the selective Desat. used in this image. The tones in general a so nice...very nice.', '2006-01-09 15:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2018759, 276211, 48717, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Powerfull capture.  This is something you should not see in this day and age.  Do I see a housing development in the distance?</td>', 'Wow!  Powerfull capture.  This is something you should not see in this day and age.  Do I see a housing development in the distance?', '2006-01-09 15:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2018771, 276467, 48717, '<td valign="top">I think you were supposed to "hit the streets", this looks studio, so it may not be the best pic to meet the challenge. Otherwise, it is a very nice photo.  Good contrast composition and focus.</td>', 'I think you were supposed to "hit the streets", this looks studio, so it may not be the best pic to meet the challenge. Otherwise, it is a very nice photo.  Good contrast composition and focus.', '2006-01-09 15:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2018817, 275184, 48717, '<td valign="top">Nice picture color, focus and exposure wise, but I think you were supposed to "hit the streets" to find a pic :-(</td>', 'Nice picture color, focus and exposure wise, but I think you were supposed to "hit the streets" to find a pic :-(', '2006-01-09 15:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2018978, 274055, 30364, '<td valign="top">Nice candid portrait.  The "matching" beard and hat make a wonderful woolly hamburger bun enclosing his face.  I suppose some will be saying "Where''s the city?", but where else are you going to find this guy but in a city?  He''s not going to look comfortable driving a tractor on a farm.  He can only be a city guy.  It''s a very good interpretation of the challenge, to choose a subject that is not the city, but is nevertheless unmistakably part of the city.   If the theme was "Africa", the face of a leopard would be equally legitimate, would it not?  Bump to 8.</td>', 'Nice candid portrait.  The "matching" beard and hat make a wonderful woolly hamburger bun enclosing his face.  I suppose some will be saying "Where''s the city?", but where else are you going to find this guy but in a city?  He''s not going to look comfortable driving a tractor on a farm.  He can only be a city guy.  It''s a very good interpretation of the challenge, to choose a subject that is not the city, but is nevertheless unmistakably part of the city.   If the theme was "Africa", the face of a leopard would be equally legitimate, would it not?  Bump to 8.', '2006-01-09 16:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019014, 276466, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I like the concept.</td>', 'Very nice, I like the concept.', '2006-01-09 16:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019057, 273403, 34396, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting in this shot.  Good focus on the subject.  I do find the hands covering the girl''s face and the "fuzzy" section in the front right detracts from the photo.</td>', 'I love the lighting in this shot.  Good focus on the subject.  I do find the hands covering the girl''s face and the "fuzzy" section in the front right detracts from the photo.', '2006-01-09 16:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019068, 275538, 34396, '<td valign="top">A nice capture.  The slow shutter speed captures the essense of "bustle" in a small town.</td>', 'A nice capture.  The slow shutter speed captures the essense of "bustle" in a small town.', '2006-01-09 16:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019078, 275972, 34396, '<td valign="top">The tilt of the photograph is a bit too much for me.  I think I would rather have it cropped with the buildings vertical and the rest tilted.</td>', 'The tilt of the photograph is a bit too much for me.  I think I would rather have it cropped with the buildings vertical and the rest tilted.', '2006-01-09 16:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019083, 276268, 34396, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Fantastic capture!  I think the city lights could use just a bit less exposure as they overpower the moon &amp; sky, but I think this will be in the top 10!</td>', 'Wow!  Fantastic capture!  I think the city lights could use just a bit less exposure as they overpower the moon & sky, but I think this will be in the top 10!', '2006-01-09 16:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019100, 276367, 34396, '<td valign="top">Stunningly dismal!  In a good way, if that is possible.  This photo captures an emotion of dismay or despair to me.  The look of a neighborhood that has lived past it''s "glory days".  Windows bricked over or covered with tin give the feeling of abandonment, yet there are still garbage cans waiting for the trashman.  The B/W treatment and high contrast is wonderful.</td>', 'Stunningly dismal!  In a good way, if that is possible.  This photo captures an emotion of dismay or despair to me.  The look of a neighborhood that has lived past it''s "glory days".  Windows bricked over or covered with tin give the feeling of abandonment, yet there are still garbage cans waiting for the trashman.  The B/W treatment and high contrast is wonderful.', '2006-01-09 16:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019115, 276241, 34396, '<td valign="top">A nice photograph.  I wonder if a bit more contrast would have made this better.  I see too much of a neutral grey which lessens it''s impact.</td>', 'A nice photograph.  I wonder if a bit more contrast would have made this better.  I see too much of a neutral grey which lessens it''s impact.', '2006-01-09 16:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019131, 273455, 34396, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture.  Definitely a scene from City Life!</td>', 'Very nice capture.  Definitely a scene from City Life!', '2006-01-09 17:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019141, 275068, 34396, '<td valign="top">An interesting photo.  I think it is a bit overexposed, the brightness of the sky blurs out the tops of the buildings and the rest of the photo has very low contrast.  Nice composition.</td>', 'An interesting photo.  I think it is a bit overexposed, the brightness of the sky blurs out the tops of the buildings and the rest of the photo has very low contrast.  Nice composition.', '2006-01-09 17:04:27.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2019150, 275099, 34396, '<td valign="top">Nice photo!  Some of the lights seem just a bit too bright.  The tower on the left with the round top, and the needle tip on the right are a bit over-exposed and appear to be blurred.  It is an interesting composition and I think will do well.</td>', 'Nice photo!  Some of the lights seem just a bit too bright.  The tower on the left with the round top, and the needle tip on the right are a bit over-exposed and appear to be blurred.  It is an interesting composition and I think will do well.', '2006-01-09 17:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019158, 275767, 34396, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I think this night shot has just the right exposure.  Enough light to see the buildings, but no so much that they become blurred.</td>', 'Very nice.  I think this night shot has just the right exposure.  Enough light to see the buildings, but no so much that they become blurred.', '2006-01-09 17:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019162, 276045, 34396, '<td valign="top">Excellent contrast and focus!  Great capture.</td>', 'Excellent contrast and focus!  Great capture.', '2006-01-09 17:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019175, 275950, 49388, '<td valign="top">Theres quite alot of technically bad qualities and I cant see much of a photographic or artistical idea behind it. With well-thought cropping I would assume this would get better grade from me.</td>', 'Theres quite alot of technically bad qualities and I cant see much of a photographic or artistical idea behind it. With well-thought cropping I would assume this would get better grade from me.', '2006-01-09 17:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019177, 276121, 49388, '<td valign="top">Theres quite alot of technically bad qualities and I cant see much of a photographic or artistical idea behind it. With well-thought cropping I would assume this would get better grade from me.</td>', 'Theres quite alot of technically bad qualities and I cant see much of a photographic or artistical idea behind it. With well-thought cropping I would assume this would get better grade from me.', '2006-01-09 17:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019203, 276076, 49388, '<td valign="top">Nice harmony all along in this one, though I dont usually like motion lines from walking people, the stable and well thought background offsets it and makes the idea viable.</td>', 'Nice harmony all along in this one, though I dont usually like motion lines from walking people, the stable and well thought background offsets it and makes the idea viable.', '2006-01-09 17:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019208, 276045, 49388, '<td valign="top">This is quite appealing picture one would expect to see in one of Disney''s christmas movies. Except that urban Rembrand.</td>', 'This is quite appealing picture one would expect to see in one of Disney''s christmas movies. Except that urban Rembrand.', '2006-01-09 17:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019217, 276448, 49388, '<td valign="top">Picture itself is nice, both technically and artistic.<br/>Actually I would say this is an excellent shot, but its nature is mediocre and thus I cant bring myself to give excellent grades.</td>', 'Picture itself is nice, both technically and artistic.Actually I would say this is an excellent shot, but its nature is mediocre and thus I cant bring myself to give excellent grades.', '2006-01-09 17:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019224, 275890, 49388, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but I would''ve made little more basic editing into it or brighten up littlebit.</td>', 'Nice picture, but I would''ve made little more basic editing into it or brighten up littlebit.', '2006-01-09 17:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019228, 275215, 49388, '<td valign="top">Nice one here. Cant say nothing else but "Nice one".</td>', 'Nice one here. Cant say nothing else but "Nice one".', '2006-01-09 17:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019231, 276211, 49388, '<td valign="top">Quite touching. Realistic and well shot.</td>', 'Quite touching. Realistic and well shot.', '2006-01-09 17:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019241, 274602, 49388, '<td valign="top">Poor ole'' beggars always get one extra grade from me.</td>', 'Poor ole'' beggars always get one extra grade from me.', '2006-01-09 17:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019248, 274862, 49388, '<td valign="top">Couple guys like this can wipe out whole city clean of cans and bottles. Getting 20c out of each can one dude takes a 2 week vacation every year.</td>', 'Couple guys like this can wipe out whole city clean of cans and bottles. Getting 20c out of each can one dude takes a 2 week vacation every year.', '2006-01-09 17:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019255, 274114, 49388, '<td valign="top">Cant really make anything out of this picture. Is there some mistake or why is it so small?<br/>Overall, nice scenery and lots of people having fun never lights me up. Would have taken either nice scenery back there or nice people into picture, but having them both side by side doesnt look good.</td>', 'Cant really make anything out of this picture. Is there some mistake or why is it so small?Overall, nice scenery and lots of people having fun never lights me up. Would have taken either nice scenery back there or nice people into picture, but having them both side by side doesnt look good.', '2006-01-09 17:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019258, 274158, 50635, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but the high degree of blurr is too much for me.</td>', 'I like the idea, but the high degree of blurr is too much for me.', '2006-01-09 17:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019278, 276399, 49388, '<td valign="top">Looks quite strange here, I dont think its within basic editing anymore.<br/>Picture itself has good original idea, which just doesnt kick in.</td>', 'Looks quite strange here, I dont think its within basic editing anymore.Picture itself has good original idea, which just doesnt kick in.', '2006-01-09 17:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019282, 275638, 49388, '<td valign="top">No pink and big signs for me. Ugh.</td>', 'No pink and big signs for me. Ugh.', '2006-01-09 17:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019283, 274114, 50635, '<td valign="top">My eyes don''t find a focal point/subject. Almost every part of the picture is quite busy--I''d like to see more calm areas.  In sum, I''d personally prefer a contrast between a more sensory-laden subject and a calmer backgroud.</td>', 'My eyes don''t find a focal point/subject. Almost every part of the picture is quite busy--I''d like to see more calm areas.  In sum, I''d personally prefer a contrast between a more sensory-laden subject and a calmer backgroud.', '2006-01-09 17:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019293, 274374, 50635, '<td valign="top">I hope I''m not missing the point, but I see a vacation-type snapshot.  I''d prefer a suject a bit more novel.</td>', 'I hope I''m not missing the point, but I see a vacation-type snapshot.  I''d prefer a suject a bit more novel.', '2006-01-09 17:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019300, 276411, 50635, '<td valign="top">I would like to see something more novel.  As it is, the scene seems a bit ordinary.  I''d try to take more risk in choosing your scene.</td>', 'I would like to see something more novel.  As it is, the scene seems a bit ordinary.  I''d try to take more risk in choosing your scene.', '2006-01-09 17:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019322, 274788, 50635, '<td valign="top">It seems that the foreground and the building in the backgroud don''t match visually.  Not that they always have to, but the blurriness and overexposure of the ice and skaters make them look somewhat like ghosts.  I find the foreground amusing, yet the background seems to be a serious study.  I suppose that kind of contrast would work sometimes, but personally I don''t see the need for it here.</td>', 'It seems that the foreground and the building in the backgroud don''t match visually.  Not that they always have to, but the blurriness and overexposure of the ice and skaters make them look somewhat like ghosts.  I find the foreground amusing, yet the background seems to be a serious study.  I suppose that kind of contrast would work sometimes, but personally I don''t see the need for it here.', '2006-01-09 17:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019336, 273892, 50635, '<td valign="top">I have difficulty getting a read on this picture.  The foreground looks conjures an urban, industrial idea, but the background impresses me as a chalet on a verdant hill.  But I''m not sure, because everything is so dark. Also, I prefer a less distinct division between foreground and background.  It''s a perfect line that divides, which make the division look unnatural.</td>', 'I have difficulty getting a read on this picture.  The foreground looks conjures an urban, industrial idea, but the background impresses me as a chalet on a verdant hill.  But I''m not sure, because everything is so dark. Also, I prefer a less distinct division between foreground and background.  It''s a perfect line that divides, which make the division look unnatural.', '2006-01-09 17:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019342, 275950, 48717, '<td valign="top">A bit too pixelated, not sure what you did.  Would have scored much higher if it were not for that.</td>', 'A bit too pixelated, not sure what you did.  Would have scored much higher if it were not for that.', '2006-01-09 17:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019346, 275950, 50635, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t really impress me as a city.  Also, I can see pixelations.</td>', 'This doesn''t really impress me as a city.  Also, I can see pixelations.', '2006-01-09 17:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019347, 275102, 48717, '<td valign="top">A little bit of a color cast, but nice picture otherwise.</td>', 'A little bit of a color cast, but nice picture otherwise.', '2006-01-09 17:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019355, 276389, 48717, '<td valign="top">I like the gritty, grainy feel to this pic, but it is a bit out of focus.</td>', 'I like the gritty, grainy feel to this pic, but it is a bit out of focus.', '2006-01-09 17:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019364, 275940, 50635, '<td valign="top">The subject (the smoke) seems wedged into a narrow space which I don''t find pleasing to the eye.  It''s somewhat hidden, behind a building on one side and next to an obscure dark space on the other.  Should a subject be so hidden?</td>', 'The subject (the smoke) seems wedged into a narrow space which I don''t find pleasing to the eye.  It''s somewhat hidden, behind a building on one side and next to an obscure dark space on the other.  Should a subject be so hidden?', '2006-01-09 17:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019367, 276215, 50635, '<td valign="top">The fact that nothing is in focus gives me the impression that the picture is just, well, out-of-focus.</td>', 'The fact that nothing is in focus gives me the impression that the picture is just, well, out-of-focus.', '2006-01-09 17:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019377, 275638, 50635, '<td valign="top">The cropping takes depth away. For me, the eyes just hit (boom!) an abrupt wall.</td>', 'The cropping takes depth away. For me, the eyes just hit (boom!) an abrupt wall.', '2006-01-09 18:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019381, 276389, 50635, '<td valign="top">I''d prefer a brighter image.  As it is, I don''t get the impression of a night city scene, I get the impression of a blackout.</td>', 'I''d prefer a brighter image.  As it is, I don''t get the impression of a night city scene, I get the impression of a blackout.', '2006-01-09 18:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019383, 275063, 2170, '<td valign="top">i think i would like this better with a tighter crop around the woman with the bag and the moving car.  good shot.</td>', 'i think i would like this better with a tighter crop around the woman with the bag and the moving car.  good shot.', '2006-01-09 18:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019386, 274853, 50635, '<td valign="top">I''d try for a more novel subject or framing.</td>', 'I''d try for a more novel subject or framing.', '2006-01-09 18:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019388, 275950, 2170, '<td valign="top">poor resolution hurts this shot.  i don''t see which in this you would consider "rich" and which you would consider "poor."</td>', 'poor resolution hurts this shot.  i don''t see which in this you would consider "rich" and which you would consider "poor."', '2006-01-09 18:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019393, 276399, 2170, '<td valign="top">pretty dark.  i think a more interesting shot would have been the pattern of the reflection on top of the cab.</td>', 'pretty dark.  i think a more interesting shot would have been the pattern of the reflection on top of the cab.', '2006-01-09 18:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019394, 275073, 2170, '<td valign="top">i don''t think this fits the challenge.  and it''s out of focus.</td>', 'i don''t think this fits the challenge.  and it''s out of focus.', '2006-01-09 18:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019398, 275328, 2170, '<td valign="top">could be rotated a bit</td>', 'could be rotated a bit', '2006-01-09 18:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019400, 275318, 2170, '<td valign="top">i think the patterns in this are great.  i could do without the curtains.  however, i don''t really see it for this challenge.</td>', 'i think the patterns in this are great.  i could do without the curtains.  however, i don''t really see it for this challenge.', '2006-01-09 18:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019412, 275215, 2170, '<td valign="top">great fisheye.</td>', 'great fisheye.', '2006-01-09 18:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2019413, 275068, 2170, '<td valign="top">poor contrast, but an ok take on the challenge.</td>', 'poor contrast, but an ok take on the challenge.', '2006-01-09 18:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
