(2020772, 273604, 34396, '<td valign="top">I like the photo.  The colors and focus are nice.  I think I like the way you have captured it from an angle.  I probably would have shot it straight on in order to capture the entire phone box, but I think it has more "character" this way.  As I''m looking at it, I noticed that the Emergency seems to be split strangely.  (EME RGENCY)  Bigger spacing between the 2nd E and the R.  It makes me wonder if it was done that way on purpose, or if it just got laid out wrong initially.  I think a good photo will draw the viewer into it, making them feel like part of the frame.  Your photo has done that to me.</td>', 'I like the photo.  The colors and focus are nice.  I think I like the way you have captured it from an angle.  I probably would have shot it straight on in order to capture the entire phone box, but I think it has more "character" this way.  As I''m looking at it, I noticed that the Emergency seems to be split strangely.  (EME RGENCY)  Bigger spacing between the 2nd E and the R.  It makes me wonder if it was done that way on purpose, or if it just got laid out wrong initially.  I think a good photo will draw the viewer into it, making them feel like part of the frame.  Your photo has done that to me.', '2006-01-10 00:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2020773, 275865, 18799, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed to have interest in both the foreground and background.</td>', 'Nicely composed to have interest in both the foreground and background.', '2006-01-10 00:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2020777, 276399, 18799, '<td valign="top">This looks overprocessed to me.  The large halo around the person is a distraction.  The subject is good though.</td>', 'This looks overprocessed to me.  The large halo around the person is a distraction.  The subject is good though.', '2006-01-10 00:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
