(2021799, 274083, 45478, '<td valign="top">Good composition and color. It''s a sad event, but a good documentary photo.  --Jennifer</td>', 'Good composition and color. It''s a sad event, but a good documentary photo.  --Jennifer', '2006-01-10 11:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
