(2022727, 276116, 40718, '<td valign="top">I''m not a typical fan of "candid", but I LOVE this shot.  I also have very few "favorites", but this one is going there.  One of only two tens in this challenge for me.  Excellent.</td>', 'I''m not a typical fan of "candid", but I LOVE this shot.  I also have very few "favorites", but this one is going there.  One of only two tens in this challenge for me.  Excellent.', '2006-01-10 17:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2022822, 275638, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good find!  I like the contradictions in the signs.I am sure you know this by now but, you forgot to crop after straightening!  (At least that''s how I presume this got such an unusual border!)  Nice anyway!</td>', 'Good find!  I like the contradictions in the signs.I am sure you know this by now but, you forgot to crop after straightening!  (At least that''s how I presume this got such an unusual border!)  Nice anyway!', '2006-01-10 18:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2022825, 275036, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice juxtaposition.  I''d like to have seen more of the police car though--it seems a bit extreme in crop.</td>', 'Nice juxtaposition.  I''d like to have seen more of the police car though--it seems a bit extreme in crop.', '2006-01-10 18:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2022828, 276411, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the lights, with a good star effect.  Why not move closer though (or crop)--I don''t think the parked cars add to the beauty or life of this city scene.</td>', 'Nice capture of the lights, with a good star effect.  Why not move closer though (or crop)--I don''t think the parked cars add to the beauty or life of this city scene.', '2006-01-10 18:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2022831, 276279, 12253, '<td valign="top">The wide angle distortion and bit of motion blur, together with the patterned street makes this a dynamic scene.</td>', 'The wide angle distortion and bit of motion blur, together with the patterned street makes this a dynamic scene.', '2006-01-10 18:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2022835, 275950, 12253, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject.  I think focusing in on the woman would have been the best composition.  Something is going on though with your camera or processing--it''s too pixelated.  Could it be an extreme crop, or perhaps too much jpeg compression.  Post in the forums if you need help after the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting subject.  I think focusing in on the woman would have been the best composition.  Something is going on though with your camera or processing--it''s too pixelated.  Could it be an extreme crop, or perhaps too much jpeg compression.  Post in the forums if you need help after the challenge.', '2006-01-10 18:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2022844, 276211, 12253, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why such scenes of poverty seem to make the best photographs, but tihs is no exception.  I would suggest cropping in on the bottom half to eliminate the featureless and blown out sky.  The lower half exposure is spot on as is sharpness.  Colors work great and it''s an emotional scene.  Nice work!    8 - would be 10 if not for the top!</td>', 'I don''t know why such scenes of poverty seem to make the best photographs, but tihs is no exception.  I would suggest cropping in on the bottom half to eliminate the featureless and blown out sky.  The lower half exposure is spot on as is sharpness.  Colors work great and it''s an emotional scene.  Nice work!    8 - would be 10 if not for the top!', '2006-01-10 18:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2022845, 273604, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very clear and saturated.  Conceptually, it didn''t hold much interest, though compositionally strong.</td>', 'Very clear and saturated.  Conceptually, it didn''t hold much interest, though compositionally strong.', '2006-01-10 18:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2022851, 274158, 12253, '<td valign="top">Love the motion blur/impressionistic effect!  I think a crop here would be even better--crop into the left center portion (getting rid of the blue legs on the right and some of the unused top to make it less "narrow" looking.  Nice work!</td>', 'Love the motion blur/impressionistic effect!  I think a crop here would be even better--crop into the left center portion (getting rid of the blue legs on the right and some of the unused top to make it less "narrow" looking.  Nice work!', '2006-01-10 18:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2022853, 276164, 35602, '<td valign="top">I loved the way the streetlamps came out on this one.  It was very softly focused, though, which will hurt your score, and the lack of color in the sky will also bring it down.  A polarizer would have saturated the sky much better, and reduced the overbright white of the snow.  Still, it is a nice composition, and the eye is easily led into the scene by the placement of the steet.</td>', 'I loved the way the streetlamps came out on this one.  It was very softly focused, though, which will hurt your score, and the lack of color in the sky will also bring it down.  A polarizer would have saturated the sky much better, and reduced the overbright white of the snow.  Still, it is a nice composition, and the eye is easily led into the scene by the placement of the steet.', '2006-01-10 18:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2022863, 273816, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very touching.  Emotional impact is strong and you captured enough detail to let the viewers know what the image is about, though the addition of the name in the title gives it a more personal touch.  Thankyou for sharing, and I hope you will find your way clear of this unfortunate incident.  Technically, I think it was a little too soft and the highlights were really blown from the background store.</td>', 'Very touching.  Emotional impact is strong and you captured enough detail to let the viewers know what the image is about, though the addition of the name in the title gives it a more personal touch.  Thankyou for sharing, and I hope you will find your way clear of this unfortunate incident.  Technically, I think it was a little too soft and the highlights were really blown from the background store.', '2006-01-10 18:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2022867, 275395, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice night capture.  My favorite part of the image is the left side of the photo.  I love the billboard and the detail on the building in the background.</td>', 'Nice night capture.  My favorite part of the image is the left side of the photo.  I love the billboard and the detail on the building in the background.', '2006-01-10 18:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2022868, 275998, 40371, '<td valign="top">I can see what you are getting at but I find the reflection distracting.</td>', 'I can see what you are getting at but I find the reflection distracting.', '2006-01-10 18:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2022871, 275099, 40371, '<td valign="top">I didn''t know they made light strands that long!  I don''t like the "search light" or whatever it is known as though.</td>', 'I didn''t know they made light strands that long!  I don''t like the "search light" or whatever it is known as though.', '2006-01-10 18:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2022872, 274853, 40371, '<td valign="top">Love the purple hue everything has taken on.</td>', 'Love the purple hue everything has taken on.', '2006-01-10 18:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
