(2023090, 276065, 24991, '<td valign="top">Would have liked this photo better if it had been exposed so that the man''s face were more visible, but that might have just been the lighting that was available.  Like this shot in black and white!</td>', 'Would have liked this photo better if it had been exposed so that the man''s face were more visible, but that might have just been the lighting that was available.  Like this shot in black and white!', '2006-01-10 20:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
