(2023263, 276058, 11951, '<td valign="top">If you spin the mouse wheel the colors look like live fireworks.  :)<br/> <br/>Awesome.</td>', 'If you spin the mouse wheel the colors look like live fireworks.  :) Awesome.', '2006-01-10 21:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2023264, 275865, 35602, '<td valign="top">Image was extremely low contrast, which I think may hurt your score.  Just some adjustments on the contrast in your editing program may have given this a bit more punch.</td>', 'Image was extremely low contrast, which I think may hurt your score.  Just some adjustments on the contrast in your editing program may have given this a bit more punch.', '2006-01-10 21:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2023265, 275950, 45589, '<td valign="top">Grainy can be good.  Too much grainy; not so good.</td>', 'Grainy can be good.  Too much grainy; not so good.', '2006-01-10 21:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2023270, 274788, 35602, '<td valign="top">Image was really overexposed near the foreground, and too softly focused.  our building in the background came out pretty good, though.</td>', 'Image was really overexposed near the foreground, and too softly focused.  our building in the background came out pretty good, though.', '2006-01-10 21:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2023273, 275184, 45589, '<td valign="top">Original.</td>', 'Original.', '2006-01-10 21:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2023279, 276348, 35602, '<td valign="top">Thought the image was too dark.  Also it was not all that strong in composition.  The foreground object doesn''t seem to fit with the rest of the image.  Also, the car to the right and the one directly left of the object are distracting.  All in all, I think a bit more scrutiny when setting up your shot and noticing every detail from one corner to the next will help considerably.  If you have the ability to look through an eyepiece on your camera, sometimes that conventional technique allows you to see more than using an lcd screen, which I hardly use anymore.</td>', 'Thought the image was too dark.  Also it was not all that strong in composition.  The foreground object doesn''t seem to fit with the rest of the image.  Also, the car to the right and the one directly left of the object are distracting.  All in all, I think a bit more scrutiny when setting up your shot and noticing every detail from one corner to the next will help considerably.  If you have the ability to look through an eyepiece on your camera, sometimes that conventional technique allows you to see more than using an lcd screen, which I hardly use anymore.', '2006-01-10 21:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2023283, 276067, 30049, '<td valign="top">I really like the feel and tone of this image.  Certainly says "busy", but also shows something for real and I can get a sense of being there.  Nice choice of sepia for this.  With the minimum amount of vehicular traffic this feels like it''s from some time long ago.  Not sure really how to describe it...but, I do like it.  Job well done!  Congrats in advance on your ribbon?  ;^)</td>', 'I really like the feel and tone of this image.  Certainly says "busy", but also shows something for real and I can get a sense of being there.  Nice choice of sepia for this.  With the minimum amount of vehicular traffic this feels like it''s from some time long ago.  Not sure really how to describe it...but, I do like it.  Job well done!  Congrats in advance on your ribbon?  ;^)', '2006-01-10 21:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2023285, 276325, 35602, '<td valign="top">Thought the image lacked a really good subject.  Admittedly, the no parking sign is well exposed and well saturated, but not interesting.  Developing an eye for composition comes with practice.  That is where I am at right now.</td>', 'Thought the image lacked a really good subject.  Admittedly, the no parking sign is well exposed and well saturated, but not interesting.  Developing an eye for composition comes with practice.  That is where I am at right now.', '2006-01-10 21:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2023287, 276116, 30049, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured a nice candid moment here.  I can almost hear Grandpa''s voice...  Great job!</td>', 'You''ve captured a nice candid moment here.  I can almost hear Grandpa''s voice...  Great job!', '2006-01-10 21:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2023289, 274158, 35602, '<td valign="top">Thought the blur did not work for the photo.  Even one depicting high speed needs at least one point of reference that has better focus.</td>', 'Thought the blur did not work for the photo.  Even one depicting high speed needs at least one point of reference that has better focus.', '2006-01-10 21:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2023292, 276367, 30049, '<td valign="top">Sad, but true.  You''ve done a nice job composing this with your choice of viewpoint.  The angles and lines come together very well.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Sad, but true.  You''ve done a nice job composing this with your choice of viewpoint.  The angles and lines come together very well.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-01-10 21:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2023298, 274755, 35602, '<td valign="top">Found the image to seem too cut in half.  Not sure why it is so white on top and so saturated on the bottom.  I have heard that a neutral density filter will equalize the light in an image and may have saturated the upper part better.</td>', 'Found the image to seem too cut in half.  Not sure why it is so white on top and so saturated on the bottom.  I have heard that a neutral density filter will equalize the light in an image and may have saturated the upper part better.', '2006-01-10 21:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2023304, 276277, 35602, '<td valign="top">The image was way too dark and lacked contrast.</td>', 'The image was way too dark and lacked contrast.', '2006-01-10 21:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2023307, 273455, 30049, '<td valign="top">;^)  I like this guy!  You''ve captured his character too I believe.  Appears to be a hard, but happy life for him.  I like the way the light bleeds into his space but there is enough on his face to make him stand out just right.  Certainly a job well done!  Good luck in the challenge, and should I congratulate you in advance for your next ribbon?  ;^)</td>', ';^)  I like this guy!  You''ve captured his character too I believe.  Appears to be a hard, but happy life for him.  I like the way the light bleeds into his space but there is enough on his face to make him stand out just right.  Certainly a job well done!  Good luck in the challenge, and should I congratulate you in advance for your next ribbon?  ;^)', '2006-01-10 21:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
