(2023751, 276120, 42984, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if u have camera shake or focus issues.  Maybe you didn''t sharpen afer resize?</td>', 'I don''t know if u have camera shake or focus issues.  Maybe you didn''t sharpen afer resize?', '2006-01-10 23:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2023754, 274474, 42984, '<td valign="top">This is a great iluustrative piece.  Excellent long lens work</td>', 'This is a great iluustrative piece.  Excellent long lens work', '2006-01-10 23:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2023757, 276121, 42984, '<td valign="top">I can''t give you a high score because it''s a bit shy of ''life'' but it is a damned fine photograph so well done.</td>', 'I can''t give you a high score because it''s a bit shy of ''life'' but it is a damned fine photograph so well done.', '2006-01-10 23:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2023773, 275948, 50928, '<td valign="top">It may have been beneficial to have shifted slightly so the sun was not cut in half by that beam...unless that was the purpose of the photo? Showing the city covering up nature''s beauty or something of the like?</td>', 'It may have been beneficial to have shifted slightly so the sun was not cut in half by that beam...unless that was the purpose of the photo? Showing the city covering up nature''s beauty or something of the like?', '2006-01-10 23:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2023780, 276211, 50928, '<td valign="top">I like how the bright colours of the woman''s clothing on the clothesline dispels the dreariness of the scene.</td>', 'I like how the bright colours of the woman''s clothing on the clothesline dispels the dreariness of the scene.', '2006-01-10 23:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2023786, 276468, 42984, '<td valign="top">This is a tricky image to evaluate.  you might be wondering why you''re not scoring well. It will be pricipally because it is difficult for the eye to find out which element to go to.  I just tried a crop from top-right to the bottom left corner being the yellow shop and the start of the red line and it''s quite powerful ... although grainy etc from being the 640x image. Try it, quite stunning.</td>', 'This is a tricky image to evaluate.  you might be wondering why you''re not scoring well. It will be pricipally because it is difficult for the eye to find out which element to go to.  I just tried a crop from top-right to the bottom left corner being the yellow shop and the start of the red line and it''s quite powerful ... although grainy etc from being the 640x image. Try it, quite stunning.', '2006-01-10 23:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2023789, 275359, 42984, '<td valign="top">i would love to be able to get fireworks like that.  Good job</td>', 'i would love to be able to get fireworks like that.  Good job', '2006-01-10 23:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2023798, 273652, 42984, '<td valign="top">Good use of timed exposure.  I would perhaps have de-centred city hall ... maybe losing the pole on the left</td>', 'Good use of timed exposure.  I would perhaps have de-centred city hall ... maybe losing the pole on the left', '2006-01-10 23:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
