(2023980, 273455, 20462, '<td valign="top">i didn''t really look thru these.  but I really like this one.  perfect combo of character and reality</td>', 'i didn''t really look thru these.  but I really like this one.  perfect combo of character and reality', '2006-01-11 00:10:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(2023981, 273455, 10686, '<td valign="top">Awesome, congrats!!!<br/></td>', 'Awesome, congrats!!!', '2006-01-11 00:10:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(2023982, 273455, 26045, '<td valign="top"><br/>Let me just say that I saw this right after midnight when the voting started, hence I''m the first commenter heheh, and now that I see it''s ribboned...shoot, man, I just knew!<br/> <br/>This is suuuucccchhh a great new york photo. I mean, that guy kinda looks like the po'' newstand old man version of deniro. ;)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Let me just say that I saw this right after midnight when the voting started, hence I''m the first commenter heheh, and now that I see it''s ribboned...shoot, man, I just knew! This is suuuucccchhh a great new york photo. I mean, that guy kinda looks like the po'' newstand old man version of deniro. ;) ', '2006-01-11 00:10:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2023983, 275939, 25397, '<td valign="top">close man, close</td>', 'close man, close', '2006-01-11 00:10:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2023993, 276367, 20462, '<td valign="top">i think the contrast and sharpness distracts the viewer.  But perhaps it distracts just enough to confuse them into thinking that this photograph is profound.  Because it isn''t.  But that''s sort of the point.  Dirty, coarse.  There is not a subject in this particular scene which I find unfortunate, but again it reminds the viewer of the city and its "nastier" corners.  detriot, no doubt.</td>', 'i think the contrast and sharpness distracts the viewer.  But perhaps it distracts just enough to confuse them into thinking that this photograph is profound.  Because it isn''t.  But that''s sort of the point.  Dirty, coarse.  There is not a subject in this particular scene which I find unfortunate, but again it reminds the viewer of the city and its "nastier" corners.  detriot, no doubt.', '2006-01-11 00:13:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(2023994, 275939, 5705, '<td valign="top">Great shot Slippy, congrats on the top 10.</td>', 'Great shot Slippy, congrats on the top 10.', '2006-01-11 00:14:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2024023, 276105, 19708, '<td valign="top">Reality:<br/>It''s an outdoor mall smack dab in the center of San Diego.<br/>It is busy.</td>', 'Reality:It''s an outdoor mall smack dab in the center of San Diego.It is busy.', '2006-01-11 00:21:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2024035, 274989, 37544, '<td valign="top">I was the one who gave you the 10. I really liked this picture. It was very different from all of the other entries. It was very refreshing to come across this image during the challenge.</td>', 'I was the one who gave you the 10. I really liked this picture. It was very different from all of the other entries. It was very refreshing to come across this image during the challenge.', '2006-01-11 00:24:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(2024047, 274788, 25232, '<td valign="top">For a score under 5 you sure got your share of comments. That means you make people look, think. That is and must be one of the goals of photography. Even if they feel uncomfortable with the image because it breaks their strict rules of composition and lighting. Even more so.<br/> <br/></td>', 'For a score under 5 you sure got your share of comments. That means you make people look, think. That is and must be one of the goals of photography. Even if they feel uncomfortable with the image because it breaks their strict rules of composition and lighting. Even more so. ', '2006-01-11 00:25:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(2024053, 276063, 43434, '<td valign="top">I had such hopes for this wee kiwi entry ... :)</td>', 'I had such hopes for this wee kiwi entry ... :)', '2006-01-11 00:26:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(2024073, 275242, 31403, '<td valign="top">sorry about the DQ, I thought this was spectacular, and gave it a 10 for what it''s worth</td>', 'sorry about the DQ, I thought this was spectacular, and gave it a 10 for what it''s worth', '2006-01-11 00:28:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2024091, 276116, 46045, '<td valign="top">i love this. wonderful.</td>', 'i love this. wonderful.', '2006-01-11 00:31:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2024098, 273455, 12253, '<td valign="top">Great post and great shot.  Congratulations!</td>', 'Great post and great shot.  Congratulations!', '2006-01-11 00:32:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(2024101, 276116, 28742, '<td valign="top">Sure, it looks like a protective Grandpa keeping the kids from stepping into the street, but what you don''t see is the hot dog vendor just outside the frame and they are waiting in line and the kids are trying to take cuts.<br/>I''m Paul Harvey with "The rest of the story"<br/> <br/>:) Congrats on an excellent photo and the ribbon, Bob!</td>', 'Sure, it looks like a protective Grandpa keeping the kids from stepping into the street, but what you don''t see is the hot dog vendor just outside the frame and they are waiting in line and the kids are trying to take cuts.I''m Paul Harvey with "The rest of the story" :) Congrats on an excellent photo and the ribbon, Bob!', '2006-01-11 00:33:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(2024106, 276367, 45343, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on a first place finish.   I think this challenge was perfect for such a busy and stark image.   You captured a feeling with this.</td>', 'Congratulations on a first place finish.   I think this challenge was perfect for such a busy and stark image.   You captured a feeling with this.', '2006-01-11 00:34:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(2024107, 273455, 28742, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the yellow! A very good and well suited image!</td>', 'Congrats on the yellow! A very good and well suited image!', '2006-01-11 00:34:17.000000', NULL, 0),
