(2029110, 276367, 20856, '<td valign="top">I was trying to think of reasons why this city "space" photo is more successful than others.  It seems as though this type of shooting can easily lead to lifeless photos that only point out the fact that there is no subject in the picture.  I realized that somehow this particular photo gives the feeling that something big just happened.  Like we just missed something exciting, and this is the wake that it left behind.  At least that''s why I enjoy your picture.</td>', 'I was trying to think of reasons why this city "space" photo is more successful than others.  It seems as though this type of shooting can easily lead to lifeless photos that only point out the fact that there is no subject in the picture.  I realized that somehow this particular photo gives the feeling that something big just happened.  Like we just missed something exciting, and this is the wake that it left behind.  At least that''s why I enjoy your picture.', '2006-01-12 03:12:01.000000', NULL, 0),
