(2041582, 274393, 45194, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone for the positive feedback.  I noticed my biggest downfall was that a fair number of people didn''t feel the picture really met the challange. If only one person had said it I would have dismissed it but it appears that several people had the same impression.  I''m pretty darn happy scoring 11th on a photo that marginally met the challenge. I''m working harder on making sure my pictures meet challanges as I have seen "average photos" score pretty well if it simply fits the challange perfectly.  This is a great site!  Thanks again.</td>', 'Thanks to everyone for the positive feedback.  I noticed my biggest downfall was that a fair number of people didn''t feel the picture really met the challange. If only one person had said it I would have dismissed it but it appears that several people had the same impression.  I''m pretty darn happy scoring 11th on a photo that marginally met the challenge. I''m working harder on making sure my pictures meet challanges as I have seen "average photos" score pretty well if it simply fits the challange perfectly.  This is a great site!  Thanks again.', '2006-01-16 08:22:10.000000', NULL, 0),
