(2544475, 276164, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice composition; the lightpost and wretahs brighten up this otherwise wet and gloomy scene. The roads look wet, but there is so much great color and detail you have captured that winter cold holidayesque feel. I took the liberty of running it through ps watercolor; its only in my workshop but I put the link here.<a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=352199" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/12611/thumb/352199.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/12611/thumb/352199.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/12611/thumb/352199.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Nice composition; the lightpost and wretahs brighten up this otherwise wet and gloomy scene. The roads look wet, but there is so much great color and detail you have captured that winter cold holidayesque feel. I took the liberty of running it through ps watercolor; its only in my workshop but I put the link here.', '2006-06-23 09:11:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(2573848, 274402, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  Terrific focus and intensity on the subject''s face.  The crop seems a tad tight on the top, but otherwise I can find little to criticize.  Very stirring urban scene.</td>', 'Great capture.  Terrific focus and intensity on the subject''s face.  The crop seems a tad tight on the top, but otherwise I can find little to criticize.  Very stirring urban scene.', '2006-07-02 01:25:23.000000', NULL, 0),
